<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">MLK - DBV</book>
  <para style="h1">MALIKO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbuli Idamane yandikigwe na Maliko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maliko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mal</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mbuli Zidamane za</para>
  <para style="mt1">MALIKO</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi wa mbuli zino</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli idamane iyandikigwe na Maliko ni imwe ya vitabu vinne va lagano mpya vikusimulila vila Yesu akalile akukala. Kila kimwe cha vitabu ivo kikutangigwa “Injili” Maanayake Mbuli Idamane. Vitabu vino viyandikwa na Matayo na Maliko na Luka na Yohana. Mbuli Idamane yandikigwe na Maliko ndo chitabu chiguhi kufosa vose muna ivitabu ivo vinne. Vilavila ikutogoligwa kuwa ino ndo mbuil idamane yandusile kuandikigwa kufosa izo zose na yandikigwa hagati ya myaka ya 65 adi 70. Ivo aelekigwe Yesu kilisito. Wamanyi wengi wakutogola kuwa mbuli ino yandikigwa kuna dibululu da Lumi ili iwagele moyo Wakilisito wakalile wakukala uko.</para>
  <para style="ip">Vilavila Maliko akumanya gesa Yohana Maliko kakala imwe wa want'hu wa haguhi wa Balinaba na Paulo. Mbali sifa yake ikabanangika vila ezile kuihalava mui nt'hambo yawe ya kitumigwa. Nt'hendwa 13:13 Kamala Maliko akaita kaidi na Balinaba 15:37, 39 Ivila ikuoneka Maliko kakala mbuya wa haguhi wa Petulo 1 petulo 5:13 Maliko hakalile imwe wa wamuonile Yesu ivo wamanyi wa Bibilia wengi wakumanya maliko kandika yala ayaonile Petulo na uo ndo mwanduso wa Mbuli Idamane gesa vila yandikigwe na Maliko. Mui Mbuli Idamane ino Maliko akutint'hisa mbuli za kuwa mwanahina wa Yesu na mafunzo ya Yesu yakuhusu siku za nk'homelezo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhutaasali</para>
  <para style="io1">Maliko akuchitambulisha chitabu chino muna 1:1,13</para>
  <para style="io1">Kamala Maliko akusimulila mbuli atendile Yesu ivo akalile Galillaya. Muna isula ya 1:14, 8:21</para>
  <para style="io1">Kamala akuisimulila nt'hambo ya Yesu kwita Yelusalemu 8:22-10:52</para>
  <para style="io1">Maliko akukomeleza kwa kwandika mbuli ya siku za Yesu ivoakalile Yelusalemu. Hamwenga na kudanganika na kubwela kwake muugima. Muna 11:1-16:8.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Yohana mbatizi akutangaza kwiza kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1">Matayo 3:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 3:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1">Luka 3:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19">Yohana 1:19</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 1:28">28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Uno ndo mwanduso wa Mbuli Idamane ya Yesu Kilisito, Mwana wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Yandusa gesa ivoyandikigwe muna ichitabu cha mlotezi Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">“Mulungu kalonga, ‘Nanimulagilize mgala nt'hume wangu ili akusasalile nzila.’<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Mnt'hu akutanga kulawa kuchiwala akulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">Mndewa nzila yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">Muisasale kumuhokela Mndewa akeza.”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Ivo mgala nt'hume iyo kakala Yohana Mbatizi. Kalawila mchiwala akubatiza na kuwalongela Mbuli Zidamane za Mulungu. Akawalongela want'hu waleke zambi zawe na wabatizigwe na Mulungu naawahalavile zambi zawe. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Want'hu kulawa isi yose ya Yudea na wakaya wose wa Yelusalemu wakala wakaita kwa Yohana kumtegeleza na wakala wakuzitogola na wakamulongela zambi zawe na kuzileka na yeye akawabatiza muna umto Yolidani.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yohana kakala kavala mwenda usumigwe na mazoya ya mnyama autangigwa ngamia na mkwiji wa baha mchigudi chake na ndiya yake ikala nzige na uki. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Yohana akawalongela, “Kulawa nie naeze mnt'hu mkulu kuhuma nie. Ambae nie sikufaya hata kuidulika na kufungula ngozi za makobazi yake. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Nie huwabatiza kwa mazi mbali yeye naawabatize kwa Muhe wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akubatizigwa na kugezwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13">Matayo 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:11">4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luka 3:21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1">4:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:13">13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Siku izo Yesu akalawa kudi bululu da Nazaleti muna isi ya Galilaya akfika kwa Yohana nae akambatiza muna mto Yolidani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Ahoaho Yesu ivo alawile muna mazi akauona ulanga ugubuligwa na Muhe wa Mulungu akamtondokela gesa njiwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Izi ya Mulungu ikahulikika kulawa kuulanga ikalonga, “Weye ndo mwanangu nikubwedile na hubwedezwa na weye.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Ahoaho Muhe wa Mulungu ukamulongoza Yesu kwita kuchiwala, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Yesu akakala siku alubaini kuno akugezigwa na Mwenembago. Uko kakala hamwenga na wanyama wa mmbago na wasank'hani wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu wakawa wakumtaza.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwatanga wakwega wanne wamkole</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12">Matayo 4:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 4:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Luka 4:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1">5:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 5:11">11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Ivo sifosile siku nyingi Yohana akafungigwa. Yohana ivo akalile mchifungo, Yesu akaita kudibululu da Galilaya. Akawalongela want'hu Mbuli Zidamane za Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Akalonga, “Chipindi cha Mulungu kulongoza chihaguhi kwiza. Ivo mkulondigwa kuzilonga na kuzileka zambi zenu na mzitogole Mbuli Zidamane za Mulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Siku dimwe Yesu ivo akalile akufosa mnk'handa nk'handa mwa ziwa Galilaya. Akawaona wakwega waidi, Saimoni na ndugu yake autangwa Andeleya wakala wakukwega somba kwa lwavu. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu akawalongela, “Nikoleni nie naniwafuze kugala want'hu kumwangu gesa vila mkalile mkukwega.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Ahoaho kila imwe akaleka lwavu lwake na kumkola Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Ivo aitile halongozi chidogo akawaona Yakobo na Yohana wana wa Zebedayo nao wakala mgati mdidalu kila imwe kakala akulakai lwavu lwake. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Ahoaho Yesu ivo awaonile akawatanga wawe wanahina wake nao wakamuleka tati yao mdidalu hamwenga na watazi wake na wakamkola Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumuhonya mnt'hu akalile na kinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:31">Luka 4:31</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:37">37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Kamala Yesu hamwenga na wanahina wake wakaingila kuna dibululu da Kapelinaumu ivo ifikile siku ya Humulo dya Wayahudi Yesu akeingila muikaya ya kufikanila Wayahudi na kuandusa kuwafunza want'hu wakalile mula. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Want'hu wose wamuhulikile Yesu ivo akalile akufunza wakakangawala nk'hani kwavila hakalile akufunza gesa wala wafunza Malagilizo ya Musa mbali kakala akuwafunza gesa mnt'hu mwenye Ukulu.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Ahoaho ivo akalile akufunza mnt'hu akalile na kinyamkela akamukilwa akatoa mazange akamuuuza, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Yesu wa Nazaleti ukulondaki kumwetu? Egu kwiza kuchangamiza? Hukumanya weye adumwenga atengigwe kulawa kwa Mulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesu akachibwakila kila kinyamkela na kukilongela, “Nyamala na umulawe mnt'hu ino.”<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Ila chinyamkela akamtingisa ila mnt'hu kamala akalila kwa izi kulu na kumulawa. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Na want'hu wose wakalile hala wakakangawala na wakaiuza, “Kwani zino mbuli zaki? Vino chikuifunza mbuli za haluse! Mnt'hu ino ana udahi wa kuchibwakila kinyamkela nacho chikutenda gesa ivo achilongele.”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Ivo mbuli za Yesu zikaenela himahima kila hant'hu muna dibululu da Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwahonya want'hu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14">Matayo 8:14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 8:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38">Luka 4:38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:41">41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Ivo walawile kui kaya ya kufikanila Wayahudi, Yesu hamwenga na wanahina wake, Saimoni Andeleya Yakobo na Yohana wakaita kui kaya ya Saimoni na Andeleya. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Ivo waitile uko wakamfika mkoi wake Saimoni kagona mdi komwa akulumwa homa, Yesu ivo afikile hant'hu hala wakamlongela mbuli iyo ya kulumwa kwa mama mkoi wake Saimoni. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Yesu akaita hant'hu hala akalile kagona mama ila na akamtoza mkono wake na kumuinula. Na mama ila akahona homa na akandusa kuwasank'hanila.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Ivo ifikile dihungile siku ya Humulo ivo imalile want'hu wakamgalila Yesu watamu wose na want'hu wala wamukilwe na vinyamkela. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Want'hu wengi wa bululu dila wakafikana hanze ya lwivi lwa kuingilila muikaya. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Yesu akawahonya want'hu wengi wakalile na matamu mbalimbali. Vilavila kaviinga vinyamkela vingi kulawa kwa want'hu na kwavila vikala vikummanya yeye niani, Yesu akavilemesa visekulonga chochote.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwalongela Mbuli Zidamane want'hu wa Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:42">Luka 4:42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:44">44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Siku ya kaidi yake nalugunzugunzu zua hadina lawa, Yesu akasegela na kwita hant'hu habule want'hu ili alombe. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Saimoni na wayage wakaita kumulonda Yesu uko eli. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Ivo wamuonile wakamulongela, “Want'hu wose waukulonda weye.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Yesu akawalongela “Chiteni kuna vibululu vimwenga va haguhi na hano nikawalongele Mbuli Zidamane na uko kwa vila niza kwa mbuli iyo.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Kamala Yesu akaita kila hant'hu mdi bululu da Galilaya kuno akuwalongela want'hu Mbuli Zidamane za Mulungu muna zi kaya za kufikanila Wayahudi na kuwalava want'hu vinyamkela.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumuhonya mtamu wa mbuza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1">Matayo 8:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 8:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12">Luka 5:12</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 5:16">16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Kukala na mnt'hu akalile na utamu wa mbuza akamwitila Yesu na akamtowela mavindi akamulomba akalonga, “Hukulomba unitende ninank'hane kwa vila humanya ukalonda ukudaha kuninank'haniza.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu akamuonela ubazi akaugolola mkono wake na kumdosa akamulongela, “Hulonda nank'hana.” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Ahoaho akahona utamu akalile nao.<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Ahoaho Yesu akamulongela aite na akamulemesa, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />“Usekumulongela mnt'hu yoyote mbuli iyo mbali wite ukailagise kwa mlava nt'hambiko na ukalave nt'hambiko gesa vila Musa awalagilize kwa vila kunank'hana.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Mbali mnt'hu ila halekile kuzilonga mbuli azitendile Yesu ivo ikamtenda Yesu aingile kwa kuifisa na kukala hant'hu habule want'hu muna mabululu yose mbali want'hu wakulawa kila hant'hu wakala wank'hali wakumkola.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akumuhonya mnt'hu aholole</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1">Matayo 9:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 9:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17">Luka 5:17</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 5:26">26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Ivo zifosile siku ndodo, Yesu akabwela kuna dibululu da Kapelinaumu na want'hu wakamanya kuwa Yesu kabwela hant'hu akalile akukala. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Wakeza want'hu wengi wakammemela hadi haulwivi hakawa habule nyafasi yakufosela. Chipindi icho Yesu kakala akuwalongela want'hu nt'hume za Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Wakeingila want'hu wanne wakalile wampapa mtamu aholole wakamgala kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Ivo hawadahile kumgala mtamu iyo haguhi na Yesu kwa vila kukala na want'hu wengi. Ivo wakakwela mdigulu na wakatobola toli kuchanya hant'hu hala akalile Yesu. Wakamtelemsa mnt'hu iyo aholole kuno wamgoneza mchilago. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yesu ivo aonile vila wakumtogola akamulongela ila mtamu aholole, “Mbuyangu nikuhalavila zambi zako.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Wamwenga wa wafunza Malagilizo ya Musa wakalile hant'hu hala wakaiuza muna myoyo yawe, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Akudahaze mnt'hu ino kulonga mbuli gesa zino? Akuitenda yeye Mulungu. Kwavila Mulungu adumwe ndo akudaha kumuhalavila mnt'hu zambi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Ahoaho, Yesu akayamanya yala yose wakalile wakuyagesa mimyoyo yawe akawalongela, “Hangi mkugesa ivo? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Vino mbuli ili ihuhile kutendeka kwa mnt'hu ino alohole? Kumulongela zambi zako zihalavigwa egu kumulongela timalala usole chilago chako wite? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Mbali huwalongelani kuwa nie Mwana wa Mnt'hu nina udahi wa kuwahalavila want'hu zambi.” Kamala akamulongela ila mnt'hu ahololile, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Timalala sola chilago chako na wite ukaya kumwako!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Ahoaho akeinuka na akasola chilago chake akasegela. Want'hu wose wakakangawala na wakamdenk'helela Mulungu wakalonga, “Hachinawahi kuona mbuli gesa ino.”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumtanga Lawi amkole</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9">Matayo 9:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 9:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27">Luka 5:27</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 5:32">32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu kaita kaidi mnk'handa nk'handa mwa ziwa Galilaya. Want'hu wengi wakamwitila nae akandusa kuwafunza. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Ivo akalile akufosa akamuona Lawi mwana wa Alifayo kakala hant'hu hakuduganyila kodi. Yesu akamulongela, “Nikole!” Lawi akatimalala na kumkola.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Kamala Yesu akakala adye ndia muikaya ya Lawi kwa vila want'hu wengi wakala wakumkola ivo waduganya kodi wengi wakalile wakumanyika watenda zambi wakala wakudya hamwenga nae na wanahina wake. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Aho hakala na wamwenga wa wafunza Malagilizo wakalile Mafalisayo ivo wamuonile Yesu akudya na watenda zambi na waduganya kodi wakawalongela wanahina wake, “Hangi akudya hamwenga na wakumanyikana ni watenda zambi na waduganya kodi?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu ivo awahulikile akawalongela, “Wagima hawakulonda mulaguzi mbali watamu ndo wakulonda walaguzi. Sizile kuwatanga want'hu wadamane kulongozi kwa Mulungu mbali watendile zambi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulinganiza mafuzo yahaluse na yachomwaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14">Matayo 9:14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 9:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33">Luka 5:33</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 5:39">39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Wanahina wa Yohana Mbatizi na Mafalisayo wakala wakuleka kudya. Ivo elo want'hu wamwenga wakaita na kumuuza Yesu, “Wanahina wa Yohana na Mafalisayo wakala wakuleka kudya mbali hangi wanahina wako hawakuleka kudya?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu akawalongela, “Habule mnt'hu akudaha kuwalongela watafi wa msola mke waleke kudya kuno msola akawa ahamwenga nao.” <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Mbali chipindi nachifike cha msola mke kuhalavigwa hagati yao na chikafika chipindi icho ndo nawaleke kudya <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Yesu akawalongela kwa mlinganyo uno, “Habule mnt'hu akulonda kukant'ha kibandikizi kulawa mumwenda mpya na kukisonela muu mwenda usakale. Ukashona kila kimpya kikubananga ula mwenda usakalena hala hatoboke hakuongezekela. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Habule mnt'hu akulonda kugela divai mpya muna imihaya ya baha isakale na akagela ila divai mpya naivitule ivo imihaya ya baha isakale ikuvitula na divai naitike na imihaya iyo naitulike. Mbali divai mpya ikugeligwa muna imihaya ya baha ya haluse.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo Mndewa wa siku ya Humulo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1">Matayo 12:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 12:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:15">Luka 6:15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Ivo wakalile wakufosa muna imigunda siku ya Humulo dya Wayahudi wanahina wake Yesu wakala wakukwanyula vint'hu gesa uhemba. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Mafalisayo wakamuuza Yesu, “Lola hangi wanahina wako wakutenda mbuli zilemesigwe kutendigwa muna isiku ya Humulo?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu akawalongela, “Vino hamsomile Mandiko Yanank'hane, kila atendile Daudi na wayage ivo akalile na nzala? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Vila Daudi aingilile muikaya ya Mulungu na kudya migate ilavigwe nt'hambiko kwa Mulungu. Mbuli ino ilawila vila Abinatali ivo akalile Mlava nt'hambiko mkulu. Na walava nt'hambiko muhala ndo wakulondigwa kudya migate iyo. Mbali Daudi kaidya na akawenk'ha na wayage.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Ivo elo, Yesu akawalongela, “Siku ya Humulo iikwa kwa ajili ya kuwataza want'hu na sio kuwatenda want'hu kuwa watwana wa siku ya Humulo. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Nie Mwana wa Mnt'hu ndo Mndewa wa Humulo.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akumuhonya mnt'hu mui siku ya Humulo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9">Matayo 12:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 12:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6">Luka 6:6</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:11">11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Siku imwenga ya Humulo, Yesu akeingila kaidi muna ikaya ya kufikanila Wayaudi na uko kukala na mnt'hu aholole mkono. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Mafalisayo wamwenga wakamgozela Yesu amuhonye mnt'hu iyo muna Siku ya Humulo ili wapate mbuli ya kumgwilila. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu akamulongela ila mnt'hu aholole mkono “Inzo hano hagati.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Kamala, Yesu akawauza wala wakalile wakulonda mbuli ya kumgwilila, “Vino, Malagilizo yetu yakulonda chitende mbwani muna Isiku ya Humulo? Kutenda mbuli zidamane egu zihile? Kuhonya want'hu egu kwangamiza?” Mbali ao wakala wabule cha kulonga.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesu akawalola wose kwa maya habwedezwe kwa vila hawamtogole akamulongela ila mnt'hu, “Golola mkono wako.” Nae akaugolola mkono wake nao ukahona. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Ahoaho Mafalisayo hamwenga na want'hu wakalile wakumtaza Helode wakalawa kunze wakalonda nzila ya kumkoma Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uyama wa want'hu ukumkola Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu akasegela hamwenga na wanahina wake akaita ubanzi wa kulawila zua mnk'handa mwa ziwa Galilaya na want'hu wengi wakamkola. Want'hu ao wakala walawa Galilaya na Yudea, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Want'hu ao wamkola Yesu kwa vila wahulika mbuli nyingi azitendile. Want'hu ao walawa Galilaya Yudea na Yelusalemu na Idumea na mwambo mwa mto Yolidani na banzi za Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Yesu akawalongela wanahina wake wamsasalile dalu dimwe kwa vila want'hu wakala wengi ili wasekumsunk'hasunk'ha. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Kwavila kawahonya want'hu wengi wala watamu wose wakawa wakumsunk'hasunk'ha wakulonda kumtoza. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Na want'hu wakalile wamukilwa na vinyamkela ivo wamuonile Yesu wakatowa mavindi hasi halongozi ha Yesu wakaguta mazange wakalonga, “Weye ni Mwana wa Mulungu!”<verse eid="MRK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Mbali Yesu akavibwakila vila vinyamkela visekuwalongela want'hu gesa yeye niyani.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwasagula want'hu kuwa watumigwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1">Matayo 10:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12">Luka 6:12</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:16">16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Yesu akakwela kudigamba na akawatanga wala awalondile. Na ao wakamkola, <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />nae akawasagula want'hu kumi na waidi na akawatanga watumigwa. Akalonga, “Niwasagula mweye muwe hamwenga na nie vilavila naniwatume kuzilonga Mbuli Zidamane, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />na kuwenk'ha udahi wa kuviinga vinyamkela viwalawe want'hu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Wano ndo want'hu kumi na waidi wasaguligwe na Yesu. Saimoni ndo amtangile Petulo <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />na Yakobo mwana wa Zebedayo na Yohana ndugu yake Yakobo awatangile zina Boanelige, manake wana wa mdudumo <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />na Andelea na Filipo na Batolomayo na Matayo na Tomaso na Yakobo wa Alifayo na Tadei na Saimoni mtoanila isi yake <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />na Yuda Isikalioti ila ezile kumbiduka Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni mkulu kuhuma Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Matayo 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14">Luka 11:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Kamala Yesu akabwela ukaya want'hu wengi wakaiduganya kaidi hadi Yesu na wanahina wake hawapatile nyafasi ya kudya ndiya kwa vila kakala akuwasank'hanila want'hu. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Ndugu zake ivo wahulike mbuli iyo wakalawa na kwita kumsola, kwa vila want'hu wakala wakulonga, “Ana chilalu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Nao wafunza Malagilizo ya Musa walawile Yelusalemu wakalonga, “Akulongozwa na Belizebuli na akulava vinyamkela kwa want'hu kwa nguvu ya Belizabuli mkulu wa vinyamkela.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Aho Yesu akawatanga na kuwalongela kwa mlinganyo uno, mwenembago akudahaze kuiinga yeye mwenyewe? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Kwa vila umwene ukaimwaga mmapelela haukudaha kugendelela. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Kamala na want'hu wa kaya imwe wakaimwaga mmapelela, kaya iyo sekeigendelele. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Ivo elo umwene wa mwenembago ukaimwaga mmapelela, haukudaha kugendelela, umwene uo nauwangamile.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Habule mnt'hu akudaha kuingila mui kaya ya mnt'hu mwenye nguvu na kusola vint'hu vake bila ya kumgwila na kumkoteleza. Akamkotela ndo naanduse kusola vint'hu vake.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Kweli huwalongeleni, zambi zose na madusi yose want'hu wadukane nawahalavilwe, <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />mbali mnt'hu akulonda kumkufulu Muhe wa Mulungu sekeahalaviligwe zambi zake mbwi! Ivo naawe ana zambi siku zose.<verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu kalonga mbuli izo, kwa vila walonga akulongozwa na Belizebuli.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndugu wa kweli wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46">Matayo 12:46</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 12:50">50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19">Luka 8:19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:21">21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Mami yake na ndugu zake Yesu wakafika hant'hu eli Yesu. Na wakatimalala kunze wakamtuma mnt'hu akamtange. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Want'hu wengi wakala hant'hu hala wamzulunguka Yesu na wamwenga wakamulongela, “Mami yako na ndugu zako wakunze waukulonda.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Mbali Yesu akawauza, “Mami yangu na ndugu zangu walihi?”<verse eid="MRK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Akawalola wala want'hu wakalile wamzunguka na kuwalongela, “Loleni want'hu wano ndo mami yangu na ndugu zangu!” <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />“Mnt'hu yoyote akutenda yala yakumbwedeza Mulungu iyo ndo mami yangu na ndugu yangu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Mulinganyo wa mnt'hu akuhanda mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1">Matayo 13:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4">Luka 8:4</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:8">8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu akandusa kaidi kuwafunza want'hu ivo akalile mnk'handa nk'handa mwa ziwa Galilaya. Want'hu wengi wakala wamzunguka hadi ikamtenda aingile na kukala mdidalu. Want'hu wose wakala mnk'handa nk'handa ya ziwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Kakala akuwafunza mbuli nyingi kwa milinganyo, mmafunzo yake akawalongela.<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Tegelezeni! Muhanda mbeyu kaita kumgunda. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Ivo akalile akuhanda mbeyu, zimwenga zikalagalila muinzila ndege wakeza wakazidya. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Mbeyu zimwenga zikalagalila muuluwe hant'hu habule ulongo mwingi. Na zihota hima kwa vila ulongo ukala mdodo, <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />mbali zuwa ivo dilawile dikalunguza ila minoga na ila minoga ikanyala kwa vila maizi yake yakala haingilile hasi nk'hani. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Mbeyu zimwenga zikalagalila mzimiwa na zila miwa zikakula na kuizingiliza iminoga hadi ikapotwa kweleka mbeyu yoyote. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Mbeyu zimwenga zikalagala muulongo udamane zikamea na zikakula na kweleka. Imwe iyeleka mbeyu salasini na imwe iyeleka mbeyu sitini na zimwenga zieleka mbeyu miya.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Kamala Yesu akawalongela, “Mwenye kuhulika na ahulike.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwalongela hangi akulonga kwa mlinganyo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10">Matayo 13:10</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9">Luka 8:9</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:10">10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Yesu ivo akalile adumwe wala want'hu wamuhulike hamwenga na wala kumi na waidi wakamkola na wakamuuza mana ya ila imilinganyo ailongile. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mweye mdaha kuzimanya mbuli za Umwene wa Mulungu zifisigwe, mbali want'hu wa kunze nawalongelwe kila mbuli kwa milinganyo, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />ili walole mbali sekewaone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">wahulike mbali wasekumanya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">ingi wamanyile wambidukile Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">na Mulungu ingi awahalavile zambi zawe.”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akwalula mlinganyo wa mnt'hu akuhanda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18">Matayo 13:18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11">Luka 8:11</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:15">15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Kamala Yesu akawauza wanahina wake, “Mweye hamuumanyile mlinganyo uno, vino mweye namuimanyeze milinganyo imwenga?” <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Mbeyu ihandigwe ni mbuli ya Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Want'hu wamwenga gesa mbeyu zilagalile muinzila, ao ivo wahulikile mbuli ya Mulungu mwenembago akwiza na kuisola. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Na wamwenga ni gesa vila mbeyu ihandigwe muuluwe, ambao wakaihulika Mbuli ya Mulungu, ahoaho wakuihokela kwa kuden'khelela, <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />mbali wakuitogola nt'hume ya Mulungu kwa chipindi chidodo kwavila ni gesa mimela ibule maizi na wakahenyeka na kugazwa kwa mbuli ya Mulungu ahoaho wakuileka mbuli ya Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Na want'hu wamwenga gesa vila mbeyu zihandigwe mzimiwa. Wano nio wahulikile mbuli ya Mulungu, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />mbali sank'hano za muisi ino, kumelela mate utajili na kumelela mate vint'hu vimwenga vingi. Mbuli izo zikuizonga mbuli ya Mulungu na want'hu ao nawawe hawakuitendela kazi mbuli ya Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Mbali wamwenga ni gesa mbeyu ihandigwe mulongo udamane. Want'hu ao ndo wala wakuihulika mbuli ya Mulungu na kuietendela kazi, imwe iyeleka selasini na imwenga iyeleka sitini imwenga iyeleka mia.<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kimuli kigubikigwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Luka 8:16</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:18">18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesu akagendelela kulonga, “Vino kuna mnt'hu akuwasha kimuliko na kukigubika na debe egu kukiiika kudivungu? Vino hakikuwashigwa na kuikwa mchanya hant'hu ha kuikilwa chimuli? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Ivoivo kin'thu chochote kifisigwe nachivumbulwe na kint'hu chochote kigubikwe nachigubulwe.” <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Mwenye kuhulika naahulike. <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Kamala Yesu akawalongela, “Tegelezeni goya kino huwalongeleni. Vilavila ivo uilavile kuihulika mbuli iyo, ndo Mulungu naakutende umanye nk'hani.” <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />“Ila mnt'hu akutegeleza mbuli ya Mulungu na kuimanya, Mulungu naamtaze na naamtende aimanye nk'hani. Mnt'hu ila hakutegeleza mbuli ya Mulungu, hata ila mbuli ndodo ya Mulungu aimanyile naaohokigwe.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlinganyo wa mbeyu ikuhota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu akagendelela kulonga, “Umwene wa Mulungu ni gesa vino. Mnt'hu imwe akumwaga mbeyu mumgunda, <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />yeye akugona ichilo na namsanya akuwa ameso kuno mbeyu zikuhota na kukula bila yeye kumanya yatendeke. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Ikala ivo kwavila ulongo wenyewe ukutenda ummea kukula na kweleka. Mmea ukuandusa kulava mazani mateke kamala ukulava maiso na kukomeleza kuwa na uhemba mna maiso. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Ivo uhemba ukakangala mnt'hu iyo akuandusa kukant'ha kwa mufu ukunjigwe kwa vila chipindi cha mulao chifika.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlinganyo wa mbeyu ya haladali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31">Matayo 13:31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:32">32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18">Luka 13:18</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:19">19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesu akawauza, “Vino Umwene wa Mulungu, chiulinganize na chibwani?” Vino chiwalongele kwa “Mlinganyo ulihi? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Umwene wa Mulungu, ukulingana na mbeyu ya haladali indodo kuhuma mbeyu zose zikuhandigwa muisi. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Mbali ikahandwa ikuhota na kuwa mti mkulu kuhuma miti yose ya mumgunda. Na matambi yake yakuwa makulu hadi ndege wakuzenga mvulu umo.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesu akawalongela nt'hume yake kwa milinganyo imwenga mingi gesa iyo, kakala akulonga nao gesa vila wadahile kumanya Mbuli ya Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Yesu halongile nao kint'hu chochote bila ya milinganyo, mbali ivo akalile na wanahina wake muhala, akawaalulila kila kint'hu.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuibwakila nk'humbi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:23">Matayo 8:23</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 8:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22">Luka 8:22</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:25">25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Siku ilaila dihungile, Yesu akawalongela wanahina wake, “Chivuke mwambo wa ziwa.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Wakauleka uyama wa want'hu ukalile hala na kwita kudidalu akalile Yesu. Wanahina wakaandusa nt'hambo ya kwita mwambo wakawa hamwenga na Yesu mdidalu. Vilavila na want'hu wamwenga wakawakola wakawa mmadalu yamwenga. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Aho Ikalawila nk'humbi nk'hulu ikaandusa kuvuma na mawimbi ya mazi yakaditowa dila dalu akalile Yesu hadi dikaandusa kumema mazi. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yesu kakala kunyuma kuingalawa kagona. Ivoelo, wanahina wake wakamwinula na kumulongela, “Mfunza, vino haukuihulika vihile kuona chikudidimila!”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yesu akenuka na akaibwakila ila nk'humbi na akayalongela mawimbi ya mazi yaziziwale. Ahoaho beho dikanyamala na kukawa ziziwa.<verse eid="MRK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Kamala Yesu akawauza wanahina wake, “Hangi mkuogoha? Vino mnk'hali mbule utogozi?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Na ao wakaogoha nk'hani na kuiuza, “Vino ino niyani hadi beho da mumto dikumuhulika akalonga?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akumuhonya mnt'hu mwenye vinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28">Matayo 8:28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 8:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26">Luka 8:26</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:39">39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yesu na wanahina wake wakeingila muna isi ya Wagelasi mwambo mwa ziwa Galilaya. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Ahaaho Yesu ivo atelemke kulawa mdidalu, akafikana na mnt'hu imwe alawile kuna amaziala, mwenye kinyamkela. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Mnt'hu iyo kakala akukala mmaziala na habule mnt'hu yoyote hadahile kumfunga kwa minyololo. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Mnt'hu iyo kakala akufungigwa ulo kwa ulo kwa pingu na minyololo, mbali kakala akuidumula ila minyololo na kuzibwena bwena pingu na hakuwile na mnt'hu akalile na nguvu za kumgwila. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Naichilo na namsanya kakala kuna amaziala na kuna amagamba na kakala autoa mazange na kuikant'ha kant'ha kwa maibwe.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Ivo amuonile Yesu kwa kutali akamkimbilila na kutoa mavindi halongozi hake, <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />akaguta, akalonga, “Yesu Mwana wa Mulungu wa kuchanya nk'hani ukulonda mbwani kulawa kumwangu? Hukulomba kwa zina da Mulungu usekunihenyeza.” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Ila kinyamkela kalonga ivo, kwavila Yesu kakala kamulongela, “Mulawe mn'thu ino.” <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Ivo Yesu akamuuza ila kinyamkela, “Zina dyako niyani?” Nae akamulongela, “Zina dyangu jeshi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Kamala vinyamkela wakamulomba nk'hani Yesu asekuwainga kwita kunze ya iisi ila.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Aho wakalile Kukala na pelela kulu da nguluwe, wakudya hank'handa na digamba. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Wala vinyamkela wakamulomba nk'hani Yesu, wakamulongela, “Chilekele chikaingile mzi nguluwe.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Nae Yesu akawatogolela wala vinyamkela, ivo wala vinyamkela wakamulawa ila mnt'hu na kuingila mzi nguluwe. Pelela dyose da nguluwe gesa elufu mbili dikapolomoka mding'enge dikaingila mmazi wakadanganika.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Kamala wala wakunzagizi nguluwe wakasumka na kwita kuzilonga mbuli izo kuna amabululu na vibululu. Want'hu wakalawa na kwita kuyalola yalawile. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Ivo wafikile kwa Yesu, wakamuona ila mnt'hu akalile na vinyamkela kakala hasi kavala mwenda na kaikomola nae ndo ila akaliile na dila pelela da vinyamkela na want'hu wose wakaogoha. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Want'hu waonile yala yalawile, wakawalongela want'hu wamwenga mbuli zila zimulawile mnt'hu ila akalile na vinyamkela na mbuli za wala nguluwe.<verse eid="MRK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Kamala wala want'hu wakamulomba nk'hani Yesu asegele muna isi yawe.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Yesu ivo akalile akukwela mdidalu, ila mnt'hu akalile na vinyamkela akamulomba Yesu wasegele wose.<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Mbali Yesu akamlemela akamulongela, “Genda ukaya na ukawalongele ndugu zako yala makulu utendeligwe na Mndewa Mulungu na vila akuonele ubazi.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Ivo mnt'hu ila akahalawa akaita kuna dibululu dikutangwa Dekapoli, kuwalongela want'hu mbuli nk'hulu atendelwe na Yesu, want'hu wose wahulikile mbuli iyo wakakangawala.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumbweleza muugima mndele wa Yailo na kumuhonya mwanachike</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18">Matayo 9:18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 9:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40">Luka 8:40</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:56">56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Kamala Yesu na wanahina wake wakakwela mdidalu kubwela mwambo uko walawile. Want'hu wengi wakamzunguluka aho mnk'handa nk'handa mwa ziwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Akalawila mnt'hu imwe mkulu wa kaya ya kufikanila Wayahudi autangwa Yailo. Ivo amuonile Yesu, akatoa mavindi halongozi ha Yesu, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Akamulomba nk'hani Yesu, akamulongela, “Mndele wangu ahaguhi na kudanganika hukulomba chite ukamulombele ahone na kupata ugima.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Ivo, Yesu akaita hamwenga na Yailo na want'hu wengi wakamkola Yesu na wakamema haguhi nae na wakandusa kumzongazonga.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Hant'hu hala kukala na mwanachike imwe, akalile na utamu wa kulawa damu kwa myaka kumi na midi. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Mwanachike ila kahenyeka nk'hani kwa walaguzi. Kaaza hela zake nyingi ili ahone mbali hahonile. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Ivo ahulike mbuli za Yesu vila akuhonya want'hu, akafosa mgati mwa want'hu wengi akamwitila Yesu kwa kunyuma na akautoza mwenda wa Yesu, <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />katenda ivo kwa vila kakala akumanya muumoyo wake, nikatoza tu umwenda wake nanihone.<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Ivo autozile mwenda wa Yesu, ahoaho ila damu ikaleka kulawa naye akamanya gesa utamu akalile nao uhona. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Aho Yesu akaona nguvu za kuhonya zitenda kazi. Ivo akawabidukila wala want'hu na kuwauza, “Niyani atozile mwenda wangu?” <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Wanahina wake wakamulongela, “Ukuuzaze mbuli gesa ino na kuno ukumanya want'hu wengi wakukuzonga zonga?” <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Mbali Yesu akagendelela kulola banzi zose ili amuone atendile ivo. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Ila mwanachike akaogoha na kugudemeka na kuno akumanya yatendeke kumwake, ivo akeza halongozi ha Yesu na kumtowela mavindi na kumulongela mbuli zose zilawile. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu akamulongela, “Mbuyangu, utogozi wako ukuhonya ivo genda kwa nt'hindiwalo na utamu wako usekukubwelela kaidi.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Wakeza want'hu kulawa kuikaya ya ila mkulu wa kaya ya kufikanila Wayahudi wakamlongela, “Mndele wako kadanganika kale, hangi ukugendelela kumgaza mfunza?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Mbali Yesu ivo ahulike mbuli iyo ikulongwa, akamulongela mkulu wa kaya ya kuifikanila Wayahudi, “Usekuogoha weye togola tu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Yesu akawalemesa wamwenga wasekumkola, mbali Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana ndugu yake Yakobo, wano ndo alongozane nao. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Wakaita kuikaya ya Yailo, na Yesu akahulika mazange na want'hu wakulila na wakwimba nyila za ndilo. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Yesu akeingila mui kaya na akawauza, “Hangi mkulila? Mwana hadanganike, ino kagona tu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Mbali ao wakamseka nk'hani, Yesu akawalava wose kunze na akawasola welesi wa imwana hamwenga na wala wanahina wake watatu, wakeingila mgati mula akalile kagonezwa ila mwana. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Kamala Yesu akamtoza mkono na kumulongela, “Talita kumi.” Manake, “Mndele inuka!”<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Ahoaho ila mndele akatimalala na kuandusa kugenda. Mndele iyo kakala na myaka kumi na midi. Mbuli izo ivo zilawile wala want'hu aingilile nao wakakangawala nk'hani. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Mbali Yesu akawalemesa, wasekuwalongela want'hu wamwenga mbuli iyo. Kamala Yesu akawalongela welesi, “Mwik'heni ndiya adye.”<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Want'hu wa Nazaleti wakumulema Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53">Matayo 13:53</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:58">58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu akasegela hant'hu hala na kwita kuna dibululu dya Nazaleti hant'hu akulile, kuno akukolwa na wanahina wake. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Siku ya Humulo ivo ifikile, Yesu akandusa kuwafunza muna ikaya ya kufikanila Wayahudi. Want'hu wengi wamtegelezile wakakangawala na wakaiuza, “Vino mafunzo yano kayapata kwani? Ni umanyi wa vilihi uno enk'hingwe hadi akudaha kutenda uzonza uno?” <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Vino ino sio ila msongola miti, mwana wa Malia, na ndungu zake Yakobo na Josefu na Yuda na Saimoni? Na lumbu zake sio wano chiukala nao? Nao wakaihilwa nk'hani na wakambela.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mlotezi wa Mulungu akutogoligwa na want'hu wamwenga, mbali hakutogolwa na want'hu wa mui isi yake na want'hu wa kaya yake na walukolo lwake.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Yesu hatendile uzonza kumwao, mbali kawalombela watamu wadodo na kuwahonya. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Yesu akakangawala nk'hani kwa vila hawamtogole.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu akuwatuma wanahina kumi na waidi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5">Matayo 10:5</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Kamala Yesu kakala akwita mvibululu vikalile haguhi na hala na kuwafunza want'hu.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Yesu akawatanga hamwe wala wanahina kumi na waidi na kuwenk'ha udahi wa kubwakila vinyamkela nakuwatuma waidiwaidi. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Kamala Yesu akawalongela, “Mse kusola chint'hu chochote mwint'hambo yenu, mbali soleni milugwa muhala. Mse kusola ndia wala sanduku wala hela mvibindo venu. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Valeni vilatu mbali msekusola myenda ya kuongezela.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />“Kaya yoyote mkulonda kuhokeligwe goya, kaleni aho hadi mkeza kuhalawa kuna dibululu idyo. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Na hant'hu hohote mkulonda kuingila ikawa hamuhokelwe na kutegelezwa, segeleni na kung'untheni matibwisi ya mmigulu yenu. Na idyo nadiwe kanyo kumwao kuwa Mulungu kawalema.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Kamala wakaita kuwalongela want'hu Mbuli za Mulungu na kuwalonda wazileke zambi zawe. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Wakala wakuwalava want'hu vinyamkela na wakuwahaka mavuta watamu wengi na kuwahonya.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudanganika kwa Yohana Mbatizi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1">Matayo 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7">Luka 9:7</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:9">9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Mwene Helode akazihulika mbuli izo zose, kwa vila Yesu kakala akumanyika nk'hani. Want'hu wamwenga wakalonga, “Yohana Mbatizi kabwela muna ugima, kwa vila kakala mulotezi wa Mulungu ndo mana akutenda udahi wa kutenda uzonza.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Want'hu wamwenga wakala wakulonga, “Mnt'hu ino ni Eliya Mulotezi wa Mulungu” Wamwenga wakulonga, “Ino ni mulotezi wa Mulungu imwe wa walotezi wa umwaka kabwelile muugima.” <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Mbali Helode ivo azihulike mbuli izo, akalonga, “Ino ndo Yohana mbatizi nimkant'hile mutwi, kabwela muugima!” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Helode katenda ivo kwavila yeye kakala kamkoma Yohana kwa ajili ya Helodia mkake, mwanawachike iyo kakala mkake Filipo ndugu yake Helode. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Helode kamtendela ivo Yohana Mbatizi kwa vila kakala kamulongela, “Havidamane Helode kumsola mke wa ndugu yako.”<verse eid="MRK 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Ivo Helodia akamwihila nk'hani Yohana na kakala akulonda kumkoma mbali akapotwa, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />kwa vila Helode kakala akumwamila. Helode kakala akumuogoha Yohana kwa vila kakala akumanya Yohana kakala mnt'hu adamane halongozi ha Mulungu. Helode kakala akubweda kumtegeleza Yohana, mbali ivo akomeleze kumtegeleza akalumila muna umoyo wake.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Mui siku nk'hulu ya kwelekwa kwa Helode, Helode kawatendela ndiya vilongozi wakulu na vilongozi wa waamizi na vilongozi wa want'hu wa dibululu da Galilaya na aho ndo Helodia akapata nyafasi ya kumkomela Yohana. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Ivo, mndele wa Helodia akengila na kuvina goya. Helode na want'hu wose awatangile wakabwendezwa nae Helode akamulongela, “Nilombe chochote icho ukulonda na nie nanikwink'he.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Kamala Helode akaiapiza akamulongela, “Nilombe chochote icho ukulonda na nie nanikwink'he hata ukalonda nusu ya umwene wangu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Ivo ila mndele akaita kumuuza mamiyake, “Nilombe chibwani?” Na mamiyake akamulongela, “Lomba mutwi wa Yohana mbatizi.” <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Ahoaho ila mndele akamwitila hima Mwene Helode akamulongela, “Hulonda unink'he haluse hivi mutwi wa Yohana mbatizi muulungo.” <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Mbuli iyo imtenda Mwene Helode awe na usungu nk'hani, mbali hadaile kulema kwa vila kaipiza na kalonga mbuli iyo halongozi ha watafi wake. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Ivo, Mwene Helode akamulagiliza mwamizi kuugala mutwi wa Yohana mbatizi. Nio ila mwamizi akaita mdigeleza na kumkant'ha mutwi Yohana, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />kamala akeza na ula mutwi wa Yohana muulungo, akamwink'ha ila mndele nae akamwink'ha mami yake. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Wanahina wa Yohana ivo wahuluke mbuli izo zilawile, wakaita kuusola mtufi wa Yohana na kuuzika.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwenk'ha ndia want'hu elufu tano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13">Matayo 14:13</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10">Luka 9:10</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1">Yohana 6:1</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:14">14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Wala watumigwa wakabwela na kuiduganya halongozi ha Yesu na kumulongela mbuli zose wazitendile na kuzifunza. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Yesu akawalongela, “Chiteni hant'hu habule want'hu mkahumule chidogo.” Kalonga ivo kwa vila kukala na want'hu wengi nk'hani wakalile wakufika hant'hu hala na kusegela ivo Yesu na wanahina wake wakala hawakupata nyafasi ya kudya ndia kwa vila wakala wakuwatendela kazi. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Ivo wakakwela mdidalu na kwita hant'hu habule want'hu.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Mbali want'hu wawaona ivo wakalile wakusegela, wakamanya uko wakwita. Nio want'hu kulawa kila bululu wakasumkila uko eli Yesu na wanahina wake waitile na ao want'hu wakalongola kufika. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Yesu ivo atelemke kulawa mdidalu, akawaona want'hu wengi nk'hani na akawaonela ubazi kwa vila wakala gesa ngoto wabule mdima. Na akandusa kuwafunza mbuli nyingi.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Zuwa ivo diswile wanahina wakamwitila Yesu na wakamulongela, “Hano chimchiwala na zuwa dikwingila. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Ivo ikufaya uwalage want'hu waite kuna amabululu na vibululu va haguhi waite wakagule ndia.” <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Mbali Yesu akawalongela “Wenk'heni mweye ndiya.” Nao wakamuuza, “Vino chite chikagule migate ya hela dinali mia mbili chiwenk'he wadye?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dinali miambili kwa chipindi kila ni maliho ya miezi minana</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesu akawauza wanahina wake, “Muna migate mingahi? Gendeni mkailole.” Ivo waitile kuilola, wakamulongela, “Kuna migate mitano na somba waidi.” <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Ivo, Yesu akawalongela wanahina wake wawalongele wala want'hu wakale mmapelela hasi mmazani. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Nao wakakala mmapelela ya want'hu hano mia na hano want'hu hamsini. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Kamala Yesu akasola ila migate mitano na wala somba waidi, akalola kuchanya kuulanga, akamshukulu Mulungu kamala akaimegula akawenk'ha wanahina wake wawagawile want'hu. Na wala somba waidi akawenk'ha wakawagawile want'hu wose. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Want'hu wose wakadya na kwiguta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Wanahina wake wakavidondola vibenza visigale va migate na somba na kumemeza visege kumi na vidi. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Want'hu wadile migate iyo wanaalume wakala gesa elufu tano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akugenda mchanya mmazi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22">Matayo 14:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15">Yohana 6:15</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:21">21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Ahoaho Yesu akawalongela wanahina wake wakwele mdidalu walongole kwita kudibululu da Betisaida mwambo mwa ziwa, chipindi icho Yesu kakala akuwalaga want'hu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Yesu ivo akomeleze kulaga want'hu, akaita kudigamba kulomba. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Ichilo ivo ifikile dalu dikala hagati ya ziwa, nae Yesu kakala adumwe mnk'handa nk'handa ya ziwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Ivo, Yesu akaona wanahina wake vila wakuvumba mdidalu, kwavila wakala wakupinzana na beho kulu. Ivo ifikile haguhi na kucha, Yesu akawaitila wanahina wake kuno akugenda mchanya mmazi akalonda kuwafosa, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />ivo wamuonile akugenda mchanya mmazi wakagesa mzimu, wakaguta nk'hondo. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Kwa vila wose wamuona wakaogoha nk'hani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Yesu akawalongela, “Msekuogoha nie ni Yesu.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Kamala akakwela mdidalu dya wanahina wake na mp'heho ikaziziwala na wanahina wake wakakangawala nk'hani, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />kwa vila wakala wank'hali hawakumanya mana ya uzozo wa migate. Umanyi wawe ukala mdala kutogola.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwahonya watamu kudibululu dya Genezaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:34">Matayo 14:34</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:36">36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Wakavuka ziwa wakeingila muna isi ya Genezaleti na uko wakatimalisa nt'hambo yawe. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Ivo watelemke kulawa mdidalu aho hao want'hu wakammanya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Na ao want'hu wakazunguluka muna isi yose na wakaandusa kuwasola watamu mmakomwa yawe na kuwagala hant'hu hohote wahulike Yesu ayaho. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Hant'hu hohote Yesu aitile mvibululu egu mmabululu egu hohote want'hu wakawaika watamu mulubuga wakamulomba nk'hani Yesu hata wadose mp'hindo ya mwenda wake na wose wamdosile wakahona.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Mafunzo wayahokele kulawa kwa wahenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:1">Matayo 15:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 15:9">9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Siku dimwe Mafalisayo wamwenga na wafunza Malagilizo walawile Yelusalemu wakaiduganya halongozi ha Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Ndo wakawaona wanahina wamwenga wa Yesu wakudya ndiya bila ya kunawa goya mikono gesa vila yakulonda Malagilizo ya Wahenga.<verse eid="MRK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Kwa vila Mafalisayo na Wayahudi wose hawakudya ndiya bila kunawa goya mikono, wakutenda ivo kwa kukola malagilizo ya wahenga wao. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Wakala hawakudaha kudya chochote kulawa mdigulilo hadi wakisunt'he ndo waanduse kudya. Vilavila kukala na vihendo vimwenga wavihokele kulawa umwaka gesa vila kusunt'ha goya bakuli na vikombe na viya va shaba.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Ivo Mafalisayo na wafunza Malagilizo wakamuuza Yesu, “Vino hangi wanahina wako hawakukola mbuli chizihokele kulawa kwa wahenga wakudya ndiya bila kunawa goya mikono?” <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mweye watapitapi, Isaya Mlotezi wa Mulungu kalotela goya kuhusu mweye hala aandikile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">Want'hu wano wakunifugamalila mmilomo yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">mbali muna imyoyo yawe wahatali na nie,<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Ao wakunifugamalila tu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">mbali wakufunza mbuli za malagilizo ya want'hu tu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">Gesa vila Malagilizo ayo ni ya Mulungu!”<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />“Mweye mkuleka kuyatoza malagilizo ya Mulungu, mbali mkuyatoza malagilizo ya want'hu.” <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yesu akagendelela kulonga, “Mweye mkuyalema Malagilizo ya Mulungu ili mdahe kuyatoza malagilizo ya wahenga.” <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Musa kawalagiliza, “Mtegeleze tati yako na mami yako na vilavila mnt'hu yoyote akulonda kumdukana tati yake egu mamiyake akulondigwa akomigwe.” <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Mbali mweye mkufunza, “Gesa mnt'hu akawa na chint'hu cha kumtaza tati yake egu mami yake mbali akalonga kint'hu icho ni kolibani. Manaake kint'hu icho kiikigwa kwa ajili ya Mulungu, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />ivo, haikufaya kaidi mnt'hu kumtaza tati yake egu mami yake. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Kwa kutenda ivo mkuzilema Mbuli za Mulungu kwa kufunzana mbuli muzihokele kulawa kwa wahenga wenu. Na mkutenda mbuli nyingi gesa izo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli zikumtenda mnt'hu asekutogolwa kumfugamalila Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:10">Matayo 15:10</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 15:20">20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Kamala Yesu akawatanga kaidi want'hu akawalongela, “Mweye mose nitegelezeni na mmanye. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Habule chint'hu chochote cha kunze ya mtufi wa mnt'hu chikudaha kumtenda mnt'hu asekutogolwa kumfugamalila Mulungu. Mbali chila chikulawa mgati mwa mnt'hu ndo chikumtenda asekutogoleligwa kumfugamalila Mulungu.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Mwenye kuhulika naahulike!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bibilia zimwenga za umwaka zibule msitali uno</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Yesu ivo aulekile uyama wa want'hu na kuingila muikaya, wanahina wake wakamulomba awalongele maana ya fumbo dila. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Yesu akawalongela, “Vino hata mweye hammanyile? Hammanyile gesa habule kint'hu chochote kulawa kunze ya mnt'hu, chikamwingila hachikudaha kumtenda asekutogoleligwa kumfugamalila Mulungu? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Hachikudaha kumtenda mnt'hu asekutogoleligwa kumfugamalila Mulungu kwavila hachikumwingila muna umoyo mbali chikuingila mmunda kamala chikulawa kunze ya mtufi. Kwa kulonga vino, Yesu katenda ndiya zose kuwa zikufaya.”<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Yesu akagendelela kulonga, “Kila chikumlawa mnt'hu ndo kikumtenda asekutogoleligwa kumfugamila Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Kwa vila kulawa mgati mumoyo wa mnt'hu kukulawa magesa yehile na uhank'hu na ubavi na kukoma na <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />ugoni na kumelela mate utajili na ubananzi na uhuni na mamelelo mate yehile na miyongo na madusi na uhenye na kudunt'huka. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Ubananzi uno wose ukulawa mgati mwa mnt'hu, uno ndo ukumtenda mnt'hu asekutogoleligwa kumfugamalila Mulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utogozi wa mama imwe akalile sio Muyahudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:21">Matayo 15:21</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 15:28">28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yesu akalawa na kwita kuna dibululu dya Tilo. Uko akeingila muikaya imwe na halondile mnt'hu yoyote amanye gesa ahala. Mbali akapotwa kuifisa. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Kukala na mama imwe na mndele wake akalile na vinyamkela, ivo ahulike Yesu ahant'hu hala, akamwitila na akatoa mavindi halongozi hake, <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />akamulomba Yesu amlave mndele wake kinyamkela. Mama iyo hakalile Muyahudi, mbali kakala mkaya wa bululu dya Silofonike mui isi ya Silia. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Ndo Yesu akamulongela, “Goza tenk'hu wana wegute, kwa vila havidamane kusola ndiya ya wana na kusumbila mbwa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Ila mama akamulongela Yesu, “Ena, Mndewa icho ukulonga ni kweli, mbali hata mbwa hasi ya haimeza akudya ndiya ilagazwe na wana.” <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Yesu akamulongela, “Kwa vila kulonga goya, bwela ukaya kumwako, kinyamkela kimulawa mndele wako!”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Ivo, ila mama akabwela ukaya na akamfika mwanake kagona mdikomwa na kinyamkela kikala kimulawa kale.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumuhonya mnt'hu akalile chinziwi na bubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Kamala Yesu akalawa kudibululu da Tilo, akafosa mgati mwa dibululu dya Sidoni hadi ziwa Galilaya na kwingila kuna isi ya Dekapoli.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dekapoli manake bululu dya mabululu kumi</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Want'hu wamwenga wakamgalila Yesu akalie chinziwi na bubu, wakamulomba nk'hani amuikile mikono na amuhonye. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yesu akamsola ila mnt'hu na kwita nae kunk'handa kutali na want'hu. Uko Yesu akagela vidole vake mmagutwi ya ila mnt'hu. Akatema mate na kuudosa lulimi wa ila mnt'hu. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Yesu akalola kuchanya kuulanga, akalava muhe kwa nguvu akamulongela, “Efata” manake, “Gubuka.”<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Ahoaho magutwi yake yakagubuka na lulimi ukalegela akadaha kulonga goya. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Kamala Yesu akawalongela, wasekumulongela mnt'hu yoyote mbuli iyo. Mbali hamwenga na kuwalemesa wao ndo wakala wakugendelela kulonga mbuli izo. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Want'hu wakakangawala nk'hani, wakalonga, “Mbuli zose azitendile zidamana, kawatenda vinziwi wahulike na mabubu wakulonga!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwenk'ha ndiya want'hu elufu nne</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:32">Matayo 15:32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 15:39">39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Mui siku izo, uyama mkulu wa want'hu wakafikana kaidi hamwenga na wakala wabule ndiya. Yesu akawatanga wanahina wake, akalonga, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Huwaonela ubazi want'hu wano kwa vila wakala na nie kwa siku nt'hatu wabule ndiya. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Nikawaleka waite ukaya kuno wana nzala wakudaha kuzehuka mui nzila kwa vila wamwenga wakulawa kutali.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Wanahina wake wakamuuza, “Hano haichiwala nachipatehi ndia ya kuwenk'ha want'hu wose wano?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu akawauza, “Muna migate mingahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Wakamulongela, “Saba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Ivo, Yesu akawalongela want'hu wakale hasi. Akaisola ila migate saba, akamshukulu Mulungu, akaimegula ila migate na akawenk'ha wanahina wake wawenk'he wala want'hu nao wakawenk'ha. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Vilavila wakala na somba wadodo. Yesu akamshukulu Mulungu kamala akawalongela wanahina wake wawenk'he want'hu ivila. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Want'hu wakadya na kwiguta. Kamala wanahina wake wakadondola vibenzu visigale va migate na kumemeza visege saba. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Want'hu wadile na kwiguta wakala gesa elufu nne. Kamala ndo Yesu akawalaga want'hu waite kumwawe, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />ahoaho Yesu hamwenga na wanahina wake wakakwela mdidalu na kwita kuna dibululu dya Dalumanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo wakulonda vilagiso</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Matayo 12:38</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 12:42">42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1">16:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 16:4">4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Mafalisayo wakeza kulonga na Yesu. Kwa kumgeza na wakamulonda atende vilagiso vikulonda kumulagisa kuwa katumigwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Ivo, Yesu akalumila mumoyo wake na akalonga, “Hangi uweleko uno ukulonda vilagiso? Kweli huwalongeleni, uweleko uno sekewank'higwe vilagiso vovote.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Ivo, Yesu akawaleka Mafalisayo, na akakwela kaidi mdidalu na wanahina wake, akandusa nt'hambo ya kwita mwambo mwa mto.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamila ya Mafalisayo na ya Helode</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:5">Matayo 16:5</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 16:12">12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Wanahina wake wakala wazimiza kusola migate ya kuwafaya ivo mdidalu wakala na mgate umwe muhala. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Ivo, Yesu akawalongela, “Loleni nk'hani! Inegeni na hamila ya Mafalisayo na ya Helode.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Wanahina wakaandusa kulongelana wenyewe wakalonga, “Akulonga vino kwa vila chibule migate.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Nae Yesu akayamanya yala wakalile wakuyagesa ivo akawauza, “Hangi mkukizana kwa vila mubule migate? Vino, munk'hali hamkumanya, wala hamkuelewa kwa vila umanyi wenu unk'hali mdala kumanya? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Muna meso mbali hamkuona na muna magutwi mbali hamkuhulika na mzimiza kale, <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />vila niimegule ila migate mitano na kuwenk'ha want'hu elufu tano? Mduganya visege vingahi vimemile vibenzu va migate isigale?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Wakamulongela, “Visege kumi na vidi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Kamala Yesu akawauza, “Vino mduganya visege vingahi vimemile vibenzu va migate visigale vila nimegile migate saba kuwalisa want'hu elufu nne?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Wakamulongela, “Visege saba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Kamala Yesu akawauza, “Vino na mweye mnk'hali hamkumanya?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumuhonya chipofu uko Betisaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Yesu hamwenga na wanahina wake wakeingila kuna dibululu dya Betisaida. Uko wakamgalila mnt'hu chipofu, wakamulomba nk'hani amdose. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesu akamtoza mkono ila chipofu, akalawa nae kunze ya bululu na akamtemela mate mmeso na kumwikila mikono na kumuuza, “Ukuona kint'hu chochote?” <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Ila mnt'hu akalola kuchanya na kulonga, “Ena huwaona want'hu wakuoneka gesa miti ikugenda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Kamala Yesu akamwikila kaidi mikono mmeso yake, chipindi chino akawa akudaha kuona goya, udahi wake wakuona ukambwelela na vint'hu vose akawa akuviona goya. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yesu akamulongela aite ukaya na akumulemesa asekubwela kuna dibululu dila.<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo akumtogola Yesu ndo Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13">Matayo 16:13</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 16:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18">Luka 9:18</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:21">21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Kamala Yesu hamwenga na wanahina wake wakaita kuna vibululu va Kaisalia Filipu. Ivo wakalile muinzila, Yesu akawauza wanahina wake, “Nilongeleni want'hu wakulonga nie niyani?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Wakamulongela, “Wamwenga wakulonga weye ni Yohana Mbatizi na wamwenga wakulonga weye ni mulotezi Elia na wamwenga wakulonga weye ni imwe wa walotezi wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Yesu akawauza, “Vili na mweye mkulonga nie niyani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Petulo akamulongela, “Weye ni Kilisito.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Kamala Yesu akawalemesa wasekumulongela mnt'hu yoyote kuwa nie ndo Kilisito.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulonga ivo akulonda kuhenyezwa na kudanganika kwake na kubwela mna ugima</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:21">Matayo 16:21</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 16:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luka 9:22</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:27">27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Kamala Yesu akandusa kuwafunza wanahina wake akawalongela, “Mwana wa Mnt'hu akulondigwa kuhenyezwa na kulemwa na walala vilongozi na wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na wafunza malagilizo ya Musa na naakomigwe na siku ya nt'hatu nabwele mna ugima.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Yesu akawalongela mbuli iyo bila kufisa. Aho Petulo akamsola Yesu na kwita nae kunk'handa akandusa kumbwakila. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Mbali Yesu akabiduka na akawalola wanahina wake na kumbwakila Petulo akamulongela, “Bwela kunyuma yangu mwenembago weye, kwa vila hukugesa mbuli za Mulungu mbali ukugesa mbuli za want'hu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Kamala Yesu akautanga uyama wa want'hu hamwenga na wanahina wake, akawalongela, “Mnt'hu yoyote akulonda kunikola akulondigwa kuilema mwenyewe na atogole kuhenyezwa na hadi kudanganika ndo anikole.” <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Kwa vila mnt'hu akalonda kuukombola ugima wake mwenyewe naauwaze, mbali mnt'hu akulonda kwaza ugima wake kwa ajili yangu nie na kwa ajili ya Mbuli Zidamane naaukombole. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Vino, mnt'hu naapate chibwani hata isi yose ikawa yake na kuno kawaza ugima wake? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Habule mnt'hu akudaha kulava ili apate ugima kaidi. <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Ivo mnt'hu yoyote akanionela chinyala nie na Mbuli zangu, mna ueleko uno wa zambi, Mwana wa Mnt'hu naamuleme akeza mna ukulu wa Tati yake hamwenga na wa wasank'hani wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesu akagendelela kuwalongela, “Huwalongeleni kweli, wahano want'hu wamwenga ao sekewadanganike bila ya kuuona Umwene wa Mulungu ukeza kwa nguvu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuoneka muna ukulu wake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1">Matayo 17:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28">Luka 9:28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:36">36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Ivo zifosile siku sita, Yesu akawasola Petulo na Yakobo hamwenga na Yohana, akakwela nao kuchanya kudigamba tali, uko wakala wadumwenga. Yesu akabiduka sula halongozi hao, <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />mwenda wake ukawa mzelu chwe! Habule mnt'hu yoyote mui isi akudaha kunyugunt'ha na kuutenda wele gesa ivo. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Kamala wanahina watatu wakawaona mulotezi Elia na mulotezi Musa wakulonga na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Petulo akamulongela Yesu, “Mfunza, idamana cheye kukala hano. Ivo, ikufaya chizenge viheha vitatu, kimwe chako na kimwe cha Musa na kimwenga cha Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Petulo na wayage wakala wamemwa na woga, ndo mana hamanyile alongeki. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Kamala dikalawila wingu dikawagubika na wakahulika izi ya Mulungu mdiwingu idyo, ikalonga, “Ino ndo mwanangu humbweda, mtegelezeni.” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Ahoaho wanahina wakalola banzi zose, mbali hawamuonile mnt'hu imwenga, mbali Yesu adumwe hamwenga nao. <verse eid="MRK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Ivo wakalile wakutelemka mdigamba, Yesu akawalemesa akawalongela “Msekumulongela mnt'hu yoyote mbuli wazionile, hadi nie Mwana wa Mnt'hu nize kubwela muugima.”<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Ivo, wakatenda vila walagilizwe, mbali wakauzana wao kwa wao wakalonga, “Kubwela muugima ndo mbwani?” <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Wakamuuza Yesu, wakalonga, “Mbona wafunza Malagilizo wakulonga ikulondigwa mulotezi Elia amulongolele Yesu?” <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesu akawalongela, “Ena, Elia naanduse kwiza na kuika goya mbuli zose. Mbali hamwenga na ayo yose, hangi muna maandiko ya Mulungu yandikwa Mwana wa Mnt'hu naahenyeke na kuzeligwa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Mbali huwalongeleni Elia keza kale, nao wakatenda yose wayalondile gesa vila iyandikwe kuhusu yeye.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumuhonya mbwanga mwenye kinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Matayo 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Yesu hamwenga na wanahina wake watatu ivo wafikile kwa wanahina wamwenga, wauona uyama mkulu wa want'hu. Na wafunza Malagilizo wamwenga wakala waupinzana nao. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Ahoaho ula uyama mkulu wa want'hu wose ivo umuonile Yesu ukakangawala nk'hani, wakamwitila na kumulamsa. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu akawauza wanahina wake, “Mkuipinza nao mbwani ao?” <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Mnt'hu imwe muna ula uyama wa want'hu akamulongela Yesu, “Mfunza, nimgala mwanangu kumwako ana kinyamkela kikumtenda apotwe kulonga. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Na ino kinyamkela akammukila akumlagaza hasi na akulawa lovu mumlomo na kuno akugegeda meno na kugagadala mtufi wose. Niwalomba wanahina wako wamlave ino kinyamkela mbali wapotwa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mweye ueleko mbule utogozi! Nanikale na mweye hadi lini? Naniwafinyilize hadi lini? Nigalileni iyo mbwanga kumwangu!” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Wakamgala ila mwana kwa Yesu. Ahoaho ila kinyamkela ivo amuone Yesu, akammukila ila mwana na akapata utamu wa kifutu na akagwa hasi na akuiyuga kuno akulawa lovu mmulomo. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu akamuuza tati yake ila mwana, “Mbuli zino zimwandusa lini?” Tata wa ila mbwanga akamulongela, “Kwandusila udodo wake, <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />ulo kwa ulo kakala akumgwisa hasi muna umoto egu mmazi ili amkome. Ivo, chikukulomba ikadahika uchionele ubazi na uchitaze!”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu akamulongela, “Eti ikadahika! Mbuli zose zikudahika kwa mnt'hu akutogola.” <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Aho, tati yake ila mbwanga akalila kwa izi nk'hulu, “Hutogola mbali utogozi wangu mdodo, nitaze nitogole.” <verse eid="MRK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yesu ivo aonile uyama wa want'hu ukuongezekela halongozi yake, akambwakila ila kinyamkela, akamulongela, “Weye kinyamkela ukumtenda mwana ino asekudaha kulonga wala kuhulika, hukulongela mulawe mbwanga ino usekumwingila kaidi!” <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Kinyamkela akatoa mazange akamulagaza ila mbwanga hasi kamala akamulawa. Mbwanga ila akaoneka gesa kadanganika, ivo want'hu wamwenga wakalonga, “Kadanganika.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Mbali Yesu akamtoza mkono ila mbwanga akamwinula, nae akatimalala.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Yesu ivo aingile mgati mui kaya, wanahina wake wakamuuza aho wakalile wadumwe, “Hangi cheye chipotwa kumulava kinyamkela ila?” <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesu akawalongela, “Habule nzila imwenga ya kumulava kinyamkela gesa ila mbali ni kwa kulomba.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulonga kaidi mbuli ya kudanganika kwake na kubwela muugima</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22">Matayo 17:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43">Luka 9:43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:45">45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yesu na wanahina wake wakahalawa hant'hu hala, wakaita nt'hambo yawe kufosela bululu da Galilaya. Yesu halondile mnt'hu yoyote amanye uko eli, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />kwa vila kakala akuwafunza wanahina wake. Akawalongela, “Nie Mwana wa Mnt'hu nanigwiligwe na want'hu wabananzi na nawanikome mbali siku ya katatu nanibwele muugima.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Mbali wanahina wake wakala hawaimanyile mbuli iyo awafunzile na wakaogoha kumuuza.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Niyani kilongozi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Ivo, Yesu na wanahina wake wakeingila kudibululu da Kapelinaumu, na ivo wakalile muikaya Yesu akawauza wanahina wake, “Ivo chikalile muinzila mukala mkupinzana mbwani?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Mbali ao wakanyamala, kwa vila muinzila wakala wakupinzana niyani naawe kilongozi hagati yawe. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yesu akakala hasi, akawatanga wala wanahina wake kumi na waidi, akawalongela, “Mnt'hu yoyote akulonda kuwa wa mwanduso akulondingwa aitende awe wa nk'homelezo na awasank'hanile want'hu wose.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Kamala Yesu akamsola mwana mdodo na akamtimalisa hagati yawe na kumkumbatila, kamala akawalongela, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Mnt'hu yoyote akulonda kumuhokela mwana gesa ino kwa ukulu wa zina dyangu, kanihokela nie, na akunihokele nie kamuhokela Mulungu anitumile.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mnt'hu hakuchipinga ahamwenga na cheye</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luka 9:49-50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yohana akamulongela Yesu, “Mfunza, chimuona mnt'hu imwe akulava kinyamkela kwa zina dyako, na cheye chikamulemesa kwa vila sio miyetu.” <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Mbali Yesu akawalongela, “Msekumulemesa mnt'hu iyo icho akuchitenda. Habule mnt'hu akudaha kutenda uzonza kwa zina dyangu, ahoaho anilonge vihile. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Mnt'hu yoyote hakuchipinga, iyo ahamwenga na cheye. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Kweli huwalongeleni Mnt'hu yoyote akawenk'heni mazi ya kung'wa kwa vila mweye ni want'hu wake Kilisito, naahokele tunzo.”<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli zikumtenda mnt'hu atende zambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Matayo 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Mnt'hu yoyote akulonda kumtenda imwe wa wadodo wano wakunitogola, atende zambi, ikufaya mnt'hu iyo afungwe ibwe kulu dakusagila muisingo yake na kusumbwa muibahali. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Mkono wako ukakutenda utende zambi, Ukant'he. Muhavu uingile muugima ubule nk'homelezo ukawa na mkono umwe, haikufaya ukawa na mikono midi na kuno ukwingila kuna moto ubule nk'homelezo. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Umo muna funza hawakudanganika, na moto ubule nk'homelezo. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Mgulu wako ukakutenda utende zambi, ukant'he. Muhavu uingile muugima ubule nk'homelezo na mgulu umwe, haikufaya ukawa na migulu midi na kuno ukwingila kuna moto ubule nk'homelezo. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Umo mna funza hawakudanganika na moto ubule nk'homelezo. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Vilavila ziso dyako dikakutenda utende zambi, ding'ole. Muhavu uingile muna Umwene wa Mulungu ukawa na ziso dimwe, haikufaya ukawa na meso yose maidi na ukasumbwa kuna moto ubule nk'homelezo. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Umo muna funza hawakudanganika na moto aukuzimika.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />“Mulungu naamfoseze kila mnt'hu muna amahenyeko gesa moto. Vila want'hu wakuhakaza nyama munyu wakawa hawana ilunguza.” <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />“Munyu udamana, mbali ukaza ula umunyumunyu, na ugelwe chibwani ili udamane kaidi? Na mweye iweni gesa munyu ukukolela mgati mwenu na mukale goya mweye kwa mweye.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akufunza mbuli ya mulume na mke kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matayo 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Kamala Yesu akasegela Kapelinaumu akaita kuna bululu dya Yudea, mwambo mwa umto Yolidani. Na uyama mkulu wa want'hu ukamkola kaidi nae akawafunza gesa vila azoele.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Ivo, Mafalisayo wamwenga wakamwitila Yesu na kumgeza, wakamuuza, “Vino, malagilizo yetu yakulonda mulume kumuleka mkake?” <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu akawalongela, “Vino Musa kawalagiliza mbwani?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Na ao wakamulongela, “Musa kachilagiliza mulume akudaha kumwik'ha talaka mkake na kumuleka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yesu akawalongela, “Musa kawaandikila malagilizo ayo kwa vila hamkufunzika. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Mbali kulawila kumwanduso wa kulumbwa kwa isi, Mulungu kalumba mulume na mke. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Ivo mulume naamuleke tati yake na mami yake na kwita kukala hamwe na mkake, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />nao waidi nawawe mtufi umwe. Ivo sekewawe waidi mbali ni mtufi umwe. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Ivo, achiyungile Mulungu mnt'hu asekuchitenga.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Ivo waingile kaidi mgati muikaya, wanahina wake Yesu wakamuuza kuhusu mbuli iyo ya kulekana. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mwanamulume akamuleka mkake na kusola mke imwenga, amanye akumtendela ugoni mkake. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Ivoivo na mke akamuleka mulumake na kusoligwa na mulume imwenga akumtendela ugoni mulumake.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwalombela wana wadodo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Want'hu wamgalila Yesu wana wadodo ili awaikile mikono na kuwalombela, mbali wanahina wake wakawabwakila. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Yesu ivo aonile vila, akapata maya, akawalongela, “Walekeni wana wadodo weze kumwangu msekuwalemesa, kwa vila Umwene wa Mulungu uwikilwa want'hu gesa wana wadodo wano. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Kweli huwalongeleni, mnt'hu yoyote akulema kuuhokela Umwene wa Mulungu gesa ivo wakuuhokela wana wadodo sekeaingile umo mu umwene wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Kamala akawahokela wala wana wadodo, akawaikila mikono akawalombela.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mnt'hu tajili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Yesu akandusa kaidi nt'hambo yake, mnt'hu imwe akamkimbilila Yesu akamtowa mavindi halongozi ha Yesu, akamuuza, “Mfunza udamane, nitendeze ili niupate ugima wa siku zose?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu akamuuza, “Hangi ukunitanga nidamana? Habule adamane mbali Mulungu muhala. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Ukuyamanya Malagilizo ya Musa, ‘Leka ugoni na usekukoma na usekubawa, na usekuhuna na umuhulike tati yako na mami yako.’”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Nae akamulongela, “Mfunza, Malagilizo ayo yose niyakola kuandusila ubwanga wangu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu akamulola kwa ubwedo na akamulongela, “Kuhungukilwa na kint'hu kimwe, genda ukagule vint'hu vose ivo wilinavo, na ukawenk'he wachiwa izo hela, ivo nauwe na utajili kuulanga, kamala wize unikole.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Mnt'hu iyo ivo ahulike mbuli izo, akaingila chiholo, akasegela hant'hu hala kuno anausungu kwa vila kakala tajili nk'hani.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Kamala Yesu akalola kuno na kuno, akawalongela wanahina wake, “Ivo naiwe ndala kwa matajili kuingila muna Uumwene wa Mulungu!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Wanahina wake wakakangawala kwa zila mbuli alongile. Mbali Yesu akawalongela kaidi, “Wanawangu, naiwe ndala nk'hani kuingila muna Uumwene wa Mulungu! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Mnyama akutangwa ngamia akudaha kufosa mditoli da sindano, mbali naiwe ndala kwa tajili kuingila muna Uumwene wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Wanahina wake wakakangawala nk'hani, wakauzana, “Niyani elo naahonywe?” <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu akawalola nk'hani akawalongela, “Kwa want'hu haikudahika, mbali kwa Mulungu seke iwe ivo, kwa vila mbuli zose kwa Mulungu zikudahika.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Kamala Petulo akamulongela Yesu, “Cheye chileka vint'hu vose, chikukola weye!”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu akawalongela, “Huwalongelani kweli, mnt'hu yoyote alekile kaya egu ndugu zake egu lumbuja zake egu mami yake egu tati yake egu wanake egu mgunda wake kwa ajili ya nie hamwenga na Mbuli Zidamane, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />naahoke bwelele haluse, kaya na ndugu na lumbu na mama na wana na migunda na mahenyeko na chipindi chikwiza naahokele ugima ubule nk'homelezo. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Mbali wengi walongole nawawe wa nk'homelezo na wala wa nk'homelezo nawawe wa kulongozi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulonga lwa katatu mbuli ya kudanganika na kubwela muna ugima kwake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Yesu na wanahina wake ivo wakalile muinzila kwita kudibululu da Yelusalemu na Yesu kakala kawalongola. Wanahina wake wakala wakukangawala na want'hu wakalile wakumkola wakala wakuogoha. Yesu akaita nao kunk'handa wala wanahina wake kumi na waidi, akandusa kuwalongela mbuli zikulonda kumulawila. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Akawalongela, “Tegelezeni! Chikwita kudibululu da Yelusalemu na uko nie Mwana wa Mnt'hu nanigwiligwe na wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na wafunza malagilizo na nawanilamule nikomwe na kunilava kwa want'hu wa sio Wayahudi. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Nao nawanizele na kunitemela mate na nawanitoe kwa milugwa na kunikoma. Mbali siku ya katatu nanibwele muugima.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo na Yohana wakumulomba Yesu ukulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matayo 20:20-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Kamala Yakobo na Yohana wana wa Zebedayo, wakamwitila Yesu wakamulongela, “Mfunza, kuna chint'hu chikukulomba uchitendele.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesu akawauza, “Mkulonda niwatendele chibwani?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Wakamulongela, “Chikukulomba ikadahika muna chisumbi chako cha Umwene, imwe akale ubanzi wako wa kulume na imwenga ubanzi wako wa kumoso muna ukulu wako.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mweye hamukukimanya icho mkuchilomba! Vino, namdahe kuking'wila chikombe cha mahenyezo hulonda kuking'wila? Egu kubatizwa ubatizo hulonda kubatizigwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Wakamulongela, “Chikudaha.” Yesu akawalongela, “Chikombe huching'wila namchingwele na ubatizo hulonda kubatizigwa nambatizwe, <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />mbali kwa mbuli ya kukala ubanzi wangu wa kulume egu ubanzi wangu wa kumoso, nie sikudaha kutenda ivo mbali nyafasi izo Mulungu naawenk'he wala awasagule.” <verse eid="MRK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Wala wanahina wamwenga kumi ivo wahulike mbuli iyo wakawaonela maya Yakobo na Yohana. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Ivo, Yesu akawatanga hamwenga wanahina wose akawalongela, “Vino mkumanya kuwa wala wakuoneka kuwa vilongozi wa want'hu, huwalongoza want'hu kwa nguvu na wakulu ao wakuwatenda want'hu wao watwana. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Mbali kumwenu isekuwa ivo, mnt'hu yoyote akulonda kuwa mkulu kumwenu akulondigwa awasank'hanile mweye, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />na mnt'hu yoyote kumwenu akalonda kuwa wa mwanduso, akulondigwa awe msank'hani wa wose. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Kwa vila nie Mwana wa Mnt'hu sizile kusank'hanilwa, mbali niza kusank'hanila na kuulava ugima wangu ili kuwagombola want'hu wengi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumuhonya chipofu zina dyake Batimayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Kamala, wakeingila kuna bululu dya Yeliko, Yesu na wanahina wake hamwenga na want'hu wamwenga ivo wakalile wakulawa muna dibululu ijo wakamuona chipofu, mwana wa Timayo atangigwe Batimayo, akalile mnk'handa nk'handa muinzila akulomba want'hu hela. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Ivo ahulike Yesu wa Nazaleti akufosa hant'hu hala, akaandusa kutanga kwa izi kulu, “Weye Yesu! Mwana wa Daudi! Unionele ubazi!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Want'hu wengi wambwakila ili chipofu anyamale, mbali yeye kakala akugendelela kutanga kwa izi kulu, “Weye Mwana wa Daudi, unionele ubazi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu akatimalala akalonga, “Mulongeleni eze.” Ivo, wakamtanga Batimayo, wakamulongela, “Usekuogoha, timalala, Yesu akukutanga.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Nae akausumba mwenda wake, akazump'ha, akamwitila Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu akamuuza, “Ukulonda nikutendele mbwani?” Batimayo akamulongela, “Mfunza, hulomba nidahe kuona.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu akamulongela, “Genda, utogozi wako ukuhonya.” Ahoaho iyo chipoifu akaandusa kuona, na akamkola Yesu muinzila.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuingila Yelusalemu kwa kudenk'helelwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Yesu na wanahina wake ivo wakalile haguhi na Yelusalemu, wakafika mvibululu va Besifage na Besania haguhi na gamba dikutangwa dya Mizeituni. Yesu akawalagiliza wanahina wake waidi, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />akawalongela, “Gendeni muna kibululu kihalongozi yenu. Vila mkaingila tu namumfike mwana mp'hunda kafungigwa na ank'hali hanampapa mnt'hu. Mfunguleni na munigalile hano. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Mnt'hu akawauza, hangi mkumfungula, Mulongeleni, Mndewa akumulonda na naambweleze mda si mwingi.”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Ivo, wala wanahina waidi wakaita na wakamfika mwana mp'hunda kafungigwa haguhi na ulwivi lwa kaya ikalile nk'handa mwa nzila, ivo wakalile wakumfungula, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />want'hu wakalile watimalala hant'hu hala wakawauza, “Mwe! Mkutendaki aho? Hangi mkumfungula iyo mwanamp'hunda?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Wala wanahina wakawalongela gesa vila Yesu awalongele, kamala wala want'hu wakawaleka wasegele nayo. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Wakamgalila Yesu ila mwanamp'hunda, kamala wakaika goya mienda yawe mchanya mwa ila mwanamp'hunda na Yesu akakwela na kukala mumgongo wamp'hunda. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Want'hu wengi wakatandika miyenda yawe muna inzila na wamwenga wakabwena matambi ya miti ya mmigunda na kuyatandaza muinzila. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Want'hu walongole na wala wawakolile kunyuma wakala wauguta na wakalonga, “Atunyigwe Mulungu! Iyo akwiza kwa udahi wa Mndewa! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Mulungu akutendela yadamane umwene ukwiza wa tati yetu Daudi. Utunya kuchanya kuulanga kwa Mulungu!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesu akaingila mdibululu dya Yelusalemu, akaita dimwe kwa dimwe kui kaya ya Mulungu na akalola goya kila kint'hu. Mbali kwa vila zuwa dikala diswa Yesu na wanahina wake wakaita Besania.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuulongela yehile mkuyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:18">Matayo 21:18</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19">19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Siku ya kaidi yake nalugunzu, ivo wakalile wakubwela kulawa Besania kwita Yelusalemu, Yesu akawa na nzala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Akauona kwa kutali mkuyu wenye mazani mengi ivo akawitila ili aone gesa naapate tini. Mbali ivo aitile kaona mazani muhala kwa vila hachikalile chipindi cha mkuyu kwima. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Yesu akaulongela ula mkuyu, “Kuandusila dielo na siku zose sekewime.” Wanahina wake wakala wakuhulika mbuli ila.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akwita haikaya ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Yesu na wanahina wake ivo wafikile Yelusalemu, Yesu akaita haikaya ya Mulungu, akaandusa kuwainga want'hu wose wakalile wakugula na kuuza vint'hu na akazibidula meza za wala wakalile wakuvunja hela na visumbi va wala wakalile wakugula njiwa, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />na akawalemesa kusola kint'hu chochote muikaya ya Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Kamala akawafunza want'hu, “Iyandikwa muna maandiko ya Mulungu yakulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:17">Kaya yangu naitangwe kaya ya kumulomba Mulungu kwa want'hu wa isi zose!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:17">Mbali mweye muhabidula na kuhatenda hant'hu hakufisila wabavi.”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na wafunza malagilizo ivo wahulike mbuli izo, wakandusa kulonda nzila ya kumkoma. Mbali wakala wakumuogoha kwa vila want'hu wengi wakala wakukangawazwa vila akalile akufunza.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Ivo ifikile dihungile, Yesu na wanahina wake wakahalawa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Funzo kulawa mumkuyu unyalile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matayo 21:20-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Nalugunzu ivo wakalile wakufosa, wakauona ula mkuyu unyala wose hadi kudisina. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petulo akakumbukila, akamulongela Yesu, “Mfunza, lola ula mkuyu uulongile yehile, unyala!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mtogoleni Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Kweli huwalongeleni, mnt'hu yoyote akadilongela gamba dino ding'oke na dikasumbwe mwibahali, nae akawa abule shaka muumoyo wake, mbali katogola kuwa mbuli zose azilongile nazitendeke, na atendelwe mbuli iyo.” <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Ivo huwalongelani, mkamfugamalila Mulungu na kumulomba kint'hu togoleni kuwa muhokela kale na namuhokele yala mulombile. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Namweye, kila mkamulomba Mulungu, wahalavileni wayenu mbuli zihile wawatendele, nae Tati yenu wa kuulanga nawalahavileni mweye mbuli zihile mzitendile. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Mbali gesa mweye mukawa hamkuwahalavila wayenu mbuli zihile wawatendile na mweye vilavila Tati yenu wa kuulanga seke awalavileni mbuli zihile mzitendile.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bibilia zimwenga za umwaka zibule msitali uno</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuuzigwa kuhusu ukulu wake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Yesu hamwenga na wanahina wake wakengila kaidi Yelusalemu. Yesu ivo akalile akugenda hai Kaya ya Mulungu, wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na wafunza Malagilizo na wahenga wakamwitila, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />wakamuuza, “Yala ukuyatenda siku zose ukuyatenda kwa ukulu uli? Na niani akwin'hile ukulu wa kutenda mbuli izo?” <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu akawalongela, “Naniwauzeni mbuli imwe, mkanilongela na nie naniwalongele huzitenda mbuli zino kwa ukulu wa niyani. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Nilongeleni, vino ukulu wa Yohana wa kubatiza ulawa kwa Mulungu egu kwa want'hu?”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Wakandusa kuiuza wao kwa wao, “Chikamulongela, Ukulawa kwa Mulungu, naachiuze hangi hamumtogole? <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Mbali chikamulongela, ukulawa kwa want'hu, want'hu nawaihizwe.” Wakawogoha want'hu kwa vila wose wakala wakummanya kuwa Yohana kweli kakala mulotezi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Ivo wakamulongela Yesu, Cheye hachikumanya, Yesu akawalongela, “Naniye sekeniwalongele hutenda mbuli zino kwa ukulu uli.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akulinganiza vilongozi wa Chiahudi na walimi wakukoma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Kamala Yesu akalonga nao kwa milinganyo, Kukala na mnt'hu imwe alimile mgunda wa mizabibu. Akauzungulusila uwa na mgati yake akazenga hant'hu ha kukamulila zabibu. Akakodisha ula mgunda kwa walimi na akaita kuna isi ya kutali. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Ivo kifikile chipindi cha mulao wa zabibu, akamtuma mtwana wake kwa wala walimi amgalile nt'haja ya zabibu kulawa mumgunda wake. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Wala walimi wakamgwila ila mtwana, wakamtowa na kumwinga bila ya kumwik'ha kint'hu chochote. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Akamtuma kaidi mtwana imwenga, iyo nae wakamulumiza mmutwi na kumtendela vihile. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Ila mwenye mgunda akamtuma mtwana wake imwenga nae wakamkoma. Ila mwenye mgunda akagendelela kuwatuma watwana wake wamwenga wengi, mbali wamwenga wakawatoa na wamwenga kuwakoma. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Mwenye mgunda kakala kasigala na mnt'hu imwe wa kumtuma, nae ni mwanake akumbweda. Ivo akamulagiliza akalonga, ino nawamtegeleze kwa vila ni mwanangu. <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Mbali ao walimi wakalongelana, “Ino ndo mulisi wa mgunda uno, ivo chimkome ili chiulisi cheye mgunda uno!” <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Ivo wakamgwila na wakamkoma wakamsumba kunze ya ula mgunda wa mizabibu.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Yesu akawauza, “Ivo, ila mwenye mgunda naeze kutendaki? Naeze kuwakoma wala walimi na kuwakodisha want'hu wamwenga ula mgunda wa mizabibu.” <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Vino, hamsomile maandiko ya Mulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">“Ibwe wadilemile wazenzi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">diwa ibwe kulu kufosa yose ya kuzengela.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Mndewa Mulungu ndo katenda mbuli ino, nayo ni ya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:11">uzonza muna meso yetu.”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Ivo wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na wafunza malagilizo na wahenga wakala wakumanya gesa mlingano ula ukala ukuwahusu. Wakalonda kumtoza kwa nguvu mbali wakala wakuogoha uyama wa want'hu. Ivo wakamleka na wakasegela hant'hu hala.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuuzwa Mbuli ya kuliha kodi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Ivo, Mafalisayo wamwenga hamwenga na want'hu wakalile wakumtaza Helode watumigwa waite wakamtege Yesu kwa kumuuza. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Wakamwitila na wakamulongela, “Mfunza, chikumanya kuwa weye ni mnt'hu ukulonga kweli muhala, wala hukumuogoha mnt'hu yoyote. Wala ukulu wa mnt'hu, mbali ukuifunza kweli ya Mulungu. Vino, ikufaya kuliha kodi kwa Kaisali? Chilihe egu chisekuliha?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Mbali Yesu akamanya utapitapi wawe na akawalongela, “Vino hangi mkunigeza? Nink'heni iyo salafu niilole.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Wakamgalila salafu. Yesu akawauza, “Vino, sula ino na zina dino daniyani?” Wakamulongela, “Ya Kaisali.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Ivo, akawalongela, “Va Kaisali mwink'heni Kaisali na va Mulungu mwink'heni Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Yesu akawakangawaza nk'hani.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akufunza mbuli ya kubwela muugima</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Kamala Masadukayo, want'hu wala wakulonga habule kubwela kuna ugima wakamwitila Yesu na wakamuuza, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Mfunza, Musa kachilagiliza vino, Ikawa mnt'hu akadanganika na kuleka mke, mbali abule mwana, ndungu wa mwanamulume adanganike akulondigwa amsole ila mgane ili amuelekele ndugu yake wana.” <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Kukala na ndugu saba. Ndugu wa mwanduso akamsola mke, nae akadanganika bila kweleka mwana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Ndugu wa kaidi akamsola ila mgane awe mkake, nae akadanganika bila kweleka mwana, na ndungu wa katatu naye vilavila. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Ivo wose saba wakadanganika bila kuleka mwana. Kamala na ila mama mgane nae kadanganika. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Vino siku ya kubwela muugima, naawe mke wa niyani? Kwa vila wose saba wakala wamsola mke iyo.<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mweye mukuhasanya kwa vila hamuyamanyile maandiko ya Mulungu wala nguvu za Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Want'hu wakabwela kuna ugima, seke wasole mke egu kusoligwa na mulume, mbali na wawe gesa wasank'hani wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Kwa mbuli ya kubwela muugima, vino hamsomile chitabu cha Malagilizo ya Musa mbuli ya chisaka kikalile chikwaka moto? Mulungu ivo alongile na Musa, Nie ni Mulungu wa Ibulahimu na Mulungu wa Isaka na Mulungu wa Yakobo. <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Yeye ni Mulungu wawagima, mbali sio Mulungu wawadanganike. Ivo mweye muhasanya nk'hani!”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lagilizo kulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matayo 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Imwenga wa wafunza Malagilizo akaingila hant'hu hala, ivo aonile Yesu akulonga goya ivo akalile akulonga na Masadukayo, akumuuza Yesu, “Ni lagilizo dili kulu kuhuma yose?” <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu akalonga, “Tegelezeni mweye want'hu wa Izilaeli! Lagilizo kulu dino, Mndewa Mulungu wetu ndo Mndewa wa udumwenga. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Mbwede Mndewa Mulungu wako kwa moyo wako wose na Muhe wako wose na kwa umanyi wako wose na kwa nguvu zako zose. <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Lagilizo kulu dakaidi ni dino ‘Mbwede miyago gesa vila ukuibweda weye.’ Habule Malagilizo yamwenga kuhuma yano.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Iyo mfunza Malagilizo akamulongela Yesu, “Mfunza, kulonga goya, kweli Mulungu ni imwe na habule imwenga kuhuma yeye. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Mbwede Mulungu kwa moyo wako wose na kwa umanyi wose na kwa nguvu zako zose na kumbweda miyago gesa vila ukuibweda weye. Malagilizo yano yakufaya kuhuma kulava nt'hambiko za kulunguza na sadaka.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu ivo aonile ila mnt'hu kalonga goya, akamulongela, “Weye uhaguhi na kuingila mu Umwene wa Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Ivo yafosile hayo habule mnt'hu yoyote agezile kumuuza Yesu mbuli yoyote.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisito niyani?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Chipindi Yesu akalile akufunza hai Kaya ya Mulungu, akauza, “Hangi wafunza Malagilizo wakulonga kuwa Kilisito ni Mwana wa Daudi?” <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Muhe wa Mulungu kakala kamulongoza Daudi, nae akalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">“Mndewa akamulongela ‘Mndewa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">kala ubanzi wangu wa kulume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">hadi niwahume wanongwa wako.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Daudi mwenyewe akumtanga Kilisito Mndewa. Ivo, ikuwaze Kilisito awe mwana wa Daudi?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Yesu akawafunza want'hu wainege na wafunza Malagilizo</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20:45-47</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Want'hu wengi wakala wakumtegeleza Yesu kwa denk'ho.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Yesu akawafunza akawalongela, “Inegeni na wafunza Malagilizo kwa vila ao wakubweda kugenda wavala nk'hanzu nt'hali na kulamswa kwa heshima mmagulilo. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Wakubweda kukala mvisumbi va halongozi muna zikaya za kufikanila Wayahudi na wakusagula kukala halongozi muna zishelehe. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Ao wakusola vint'hu va wagane kwa nguvu kuno wakuitenda wakulomba nk'hani. Mbali siku ya ulamuzi nawalamulwe.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sadaka ya mama mgane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesu ivo akalile haguhi na chia cha kulavila sadaka chikalile hai Kaya ya Mulungu. Akawaona want'hu wengi wakulava hela na kuziguma muna chia cha kuikila sadaka. Na want'hu matajili wengi wakalava hela nyingi. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Kamala akeza mama mgane mchiwa nae akaguma semti mbili. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Ahoaho Yesu akawatanga wanahina wake, akawalongela, “Kweli huwalongelani mgane ino mchiwa, kaika hela nyingi muna chiya cha kuikila sadaka kuhuma wamwenga wose wagumile. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Kwa vila wamwenga wose walava hela zongezekele kulawa muutajili wawe, mbali ino mama mgane na uchiwa wake kalava ingama.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akulonga mbuli ya kubomolwa kwa Kaya ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Yesu ivo akalile akulawa kui Kaya ya Mulungu, imwe wa mwanahina wake akamulongela, “Mfunza, lola maibwe yano ya kaya zino ivo zidamane nk'hani!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu akamulongela, “Vino, ukukangawala kuyaona mazumba yano ivo makulu? Habule hata ibwe dimwe dikulonda kusigala mchanya mwa dimwenga, kila ibwe nadibomolwe.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugaya na kuhenyezwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matayo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesu ivo akalile mchanya mdigamba dikutangwa mizeituni haguhi na Kaya ya Mulungu, aho Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana na Endelea ivo wakalile wadumwe wakamuuza Yesu, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Chilongele mbuli izo nazilawile lini? Na chilongele vilagiso vake ni vili vikulonda kulagisa mbuli izo zihaguhi kulawila?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesu akandusa kuwalongela, “Muiteganye msekwiza kuhunilwa na mnt'hu yoyote. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Want'hu wengi naweze kwa zina dyangu na kulonga uhuni, nakulonga, ‘Nie ndo Kilisito.’ Na kuwahunila want'hu wengi. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Msekuogoha mkahulika mbuli za nk'hondo na kambwekambwe za nk'hondo. Mbuli izo nazilawile, mbali seke iwe ndo nk'homelezo. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Want'hu wa isi imwe nawatoane na want'hu wa isi imwenga, want'hu wa umwene nawatoane na want'hu wa umwene umwenga. Nakuwe na gudemeko dya ulongo na nzala. Mbuli zino naziwe ni gesa mwanduso tu wa mahenyezo.” <verse eid="MRK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />“Mbali mweye muiteganye. Kwa vila namugwilwe na kugalwa mvitala, namtoigwe muna zi kaya za kufikanila Wayahudi. Namgaligwe halongozi ha vilongozi na mamwene kwa ajili yangu ili mukawalongela Mbuli Zidamane za Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Mbuli Idamane ikulondigwa ilongigwe tenk'hu kwa want'hu wa isi zose. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Wakawagwileni na kuwagala muna vitala, msekuogoha kugesa namulonge mbwani. Chipindi icho, longeni chochote mkulonda kwink'higwa, kwa vila sio mweye na mulonge mbali ni Muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Aho ndugu naamulave ndugu yake akomigwe na tata naamulave mwanake akomigwe. Wana nao nawawatoe welesi wao na kuwakoma. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Want'hu wose nawawehile mweye kwa vila mkunikola nie. Mbali akulonda kufinyiliza hadi nk'homelezo ndo naahonyeke.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahenyeko makulu yakwiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matayo 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“Mkeza kuona kint'hu kikumwihiza Mulungu ki mui Kaya yake. Want'hu wala wa muna isi ya Yudea wasumkile mmagamba. Mnt'hu akasoma naamanye. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Mnt'hu akunze ya kaya yake asekuingila mgati ya kaya yake kusola kint'hu chochote. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Mnt'hu eli kumgunda asekubwela ukaya kusola mwenda wake. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Nawaluone nk'hani wanake weli na inda na wala wakuonk'heza mzi siku izo! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Lombeni Mulungu nk'hani mbuli izo zise kulawila muna kihuhwe. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Muna zisiku izo nakuwe na mahenyeko makulu nk'hani hayanawahi kulawila kuandusila aho Mulungu aumbile isi hadi dielo na sekeyeze kulawila kaidi. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Ingi Mndewa hazihunguze siku izo, habule hata mnt'hu imwe alondile kuhona. Mbali kwaajili ya want'hu wake awasagule, Mndewa naazihunguze siku izo.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Muna zi siku izo mnt'hu akawalongela, ‘Loleni, Kilisito ahano egu Ahala.’ Msekumtogola, <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />kwa vila nakulawile walotezi wa uhuni na want'hu wakuitanga, ‘Kilisito.’ Nao nawatende vilagiso na uzonza, ikadahika kuwahunila want'hu wa Mulungu wala awasagule. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Iteganyeni, kwavila nie niwalongela kale mbuli zose zikulonda kulawila.”<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana wa Mnt'hu akwiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Ivo, siku izo za mahenyeko zikafosa zuwa nadiwe na ziza na mulenge sekeulave lumuli lwake. <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Nt'hondo nazilagale na vint'hu va kuchanya kuulanga navitingisike. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Kamala want'hu nawanione nie Mwana wa Mnt'hu hwiza muna mdi wingu kwa nguvu nyingi na ukulu. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Kamala naniwatume wasank'hani wa kuulanga kwita banzi zose za isi kuwaduganya want'hu wasaguligwe na Mulungu kulawa banzi imwe hadi banzi imwenga ya isi.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Funzo kulawa mumkuyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Ifunzeni mbuli ino kulawa mumkuyu, mkaona muna matambi yake, mazani mateke yakusuka mmanye ni chipindi cha mulao. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Vilavila na mweye mkaona mbuli zila niwalongele zilawila, manyeni nie Mwana wa Mnt'hu nihaguhi nk'hani kwiza. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Kweli huwalongela, weleko uno sekeubwele kwa Mulungu hadi mbuli izo zose zilawile. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Ulanga na isi navibwele kwa Mulungu mbali mbuli zangu sekezifose mbwi.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Habule mnt'hu aimanyile siku wala saa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matayo 24:36-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Mbuli ya siku egu saa ya kubwela kwangu nie Mwana wa Mnt'hu habule mnt'hu yoyote aimanyile naiwe lini. Hata nie Mwana wa Mnt'hu siimanyile, ni Tata adumwe ndo akuimanya. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Muiteganye na mkale tiali kwavila hamkumanya chipindi icho nakiwe lini. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Naiwe gesa vila mnt'hu aitile nt'hambo, kuno kaleka kaya yake na watwna wake na kamwink'ha kila mnt'hu mbuli yake ya kutenda na akamulagiliza mwamizi awaamile. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Ivo, chelezeni kwa vila hammanyile mwenye kaya naabwele lini, ikudaha kuwa dihungile egu muna ichilo kikulu egu lukwili egu nalugunzu. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Chelezeni ikawa naabwele kwa kutukiza asekuwafika mgona. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Kino huwalongela mweye vilavila huwalongela want'hu wose chelezeni!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Nzila ya kumkomela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Zikala zisigala siku mbili ili ifike siku nk'hulu ya Pasaka na ya migate haigeligwe hamila. Walava nt'hambiko wakulu na wafunza Malagilizo wakala wakulonda nzila ya kumgwila Yesu kwa mbuli za kumziga ili wamkome. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Mbali wakalonga, “Chisekumgwila muna isiku nk'hulu ya Pasaka, want'hu wasekwiza kugala timbwayaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanamke akumuhaka Yesu mavuta</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesu ivo akalile Besania muna ikaya ya Saimoni mnt'hu akalaga na utamu wa mbuza. Ivo akalile akudya ndia akeza mwanamke imwe atozile nshupa ikalile ina mavuta yakunukia mp'homvya idamane, nayo yauguligwa kwa hela nyingi, akifungula ila nshupa na kumgidila Yesu mmutwi. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Want'hu wamwenga wakalile hant'hu hala wakapata maya, wakawa wakuiuza, “vino hangi akuyaza bule mavuta yano? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Mavuta yano ingi yaguligwe kwa hela nyingi na hela kuwenk'ha wachiwa! Kamala wakambwakila nk'hani ila mwanachike.”<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Mbali Yesu akawalongela, “Mlekeni! Vino hangi mkumgaza? Yeye kanitendela mbuli idamane nk'hani. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Wachiwa munao siku zose, mkudaha kuwataza chipindi chochote icho mkulonda. Mbali nie sekeniwe na mweye siku zose. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Kwa vila mwanamke ino katenda vila adahile, kauhaka mavuta mtufi wangu kwa ajili ya kuwika tiali kwa kuzikigwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Huwalongela kweli, hant'hu hohote muna isi, hakulonda kulongigwa mbuli Idamane, mbuli ino aitendile mwanamke ino nailongigwe kwa ukumbuso wake.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda akutogola kumbiduka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Kamala Yuda Isikaliyote, imwenga wa wala wanahina kumi na waidi, akaita kwa walava nt'hambiko wakulu ili ambiduke Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Walava nt'hambiko wakulu ivo wahulike mbuli izo wakadenk'helela, wakamulongela Yuda nawamwink'he hela. Ivo, Yuda akaandusa kulonda nzila ikulonda kumtenda Yesu agwilingwe na walava nt'hambiko.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akudya ndia ya Pasaka hamwenga na wanahina wake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luka 22:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:23">Luka 21:23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Muna siku ya mwanduso ya siku nk'hulu ya migate haigeligwe ugwadu, chipindi chila Mwanangoto wa Pasaka akuchinjwa, wanahina wake wakamuuza, “Ukulonda chite chikakusasalile kwani ndia ya Pasaka?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Kamala Yesu akawatuma wanahina wake waidi kulawa mwa wala wanahina wake, akawalongela, “Gendeni kuna dibululu uko nammuone mwanamulume kapapa biga da mazi. Mweye mkoleni, <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />hadi muikaya akulonda kuingila, na mkafika mulongeleni mwenye kaya iyo, ‘Chikwani chumba changu cha kudila Pasaka hamwenga na wanahina wangu?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Nae naawalagise chumba kikulu kuchanya mdilingo kiikigwe goya. Ivo sasaleni chidile Pasaka umo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Wanahina wakahalawa na wakaita kuna dibululu, wakafika kila kint'hu gesa vila Yesu awalongele, na ao wakasasala ndia ya Pasaka.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Ivo ifikile dihungile, Yesu akeza mui kaya ila hamwenga na wala wanahina wake kumi na waidi. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Ivo wakalile haukudya, Yesu akawalongela, “Kweli huwalongela, imwe hagati yenu nae akudya hamwenga na nie, naanibiduke.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Aho wanahina wake wakaingila chiholo, kila imwe akamuuza Yesu, “Vino, ni nie?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesu akawalongela, “Ni imwe kulawala mmwenu mweye wanahina kumi na waidi, nae akuchofeka mgate hamwenga na nie mdibakuli. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Nie Mwana wa Mnt'hu nanidanganike gesa vila yandikigwe muna ichitabu cha Mulungu, mbali naaluone mnt'hu ila akunibiduka nie Mwana wa Mnt'hu! Saingi iwile goya mnt'hu iyo asekuelekigwa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndia ya Mndewa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Wakolinto 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Ivo wakalile wakudya, Yesu akasola mgate na akamwik'ha hewala Mulungu akaumegula mgate na kuwenk'ha wanahina wake akawalongela, “Soleni mudye uno ndo mtufi wangu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Kamala akasola chikombe cha divai, akamwik'ha hewala Mulungu, akawenk'ha wanahina wake wose wakaking'wila chikombe icho. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Yesu akawalongela, “Ino ndo damu yangu ikulagisa Lagano da Mulungu na want'hu wose, damu ikutika kwaajili ya want'hu wengi. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Kweli huwalongela, seke ning'we kaidi divai hadi siku ila hulonda kuing'wa divai idamane muna Umwene wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Kamala wakaimba wila wa kumtunya Mulungu, ivo wakomeleze kuimba wakahalawa wakaita kudi Gamba da Mizeituni.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulotela Petulo naambele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Ivo wakalile muinzila Yesu akawalongela wanahina wake, Mweye mose namnisumke na kunileka nidumwe, gesa vila iyandikigwe muna mandiko ya Mulungu, Mulungu akalonga, “Nanimtoe mdima, na wanangoto nawapwimwiluke. <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Mbali nikabwela muna ugima naniwalongole kwita Galilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Kamala Petulo akamulongela Yesu, “Leka wamwenga wakusumke mbali nie sekenikuleke mbwi!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesu akamulongela Petulo, “Kweli hukulongela, ichilo chino, nzogolo hanalila lwa kaidi, weye naunibele mala nt'hatu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Mbali Petulo akagendelela kulonga, “Hata nikalondigwa kudanganika hamwenga na weye, seke nikuleke mbwi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">Na wanahina wamwenga wakalonga ivoivo.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumulomba Mulungu uko Getisemani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matayo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Ivo wakaita hadi hant'hu hakutangwa Getisemani. Yesu akawalongela wanahina wake, “Kaleni hano chipindi nie hwita kumulomba Mulungu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Kamala akawasola Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana akaita nao hatali kidogo na akaandusa kugazwa na kuhenyeka muumoyo, <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />akawalongela, “Usungu niwile nao muumoyo wangu ni mkulu nk'hani ukudaha kunikoma. Kaleni hano na chelezeni.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Yesu akaita halongozi chidogo, akaigwisa kingubingubi akamulomba Mulungu, akalonga, “Ikadahika nisekufosela mahenyeko yano.” <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Akalonga, “Tati yangu kumwako mbuli zose zikudahika, hukulomba unisegezele chikombe chino cha mahenyeko, mbali isekuwa gesa vila hulonda nie, mbali iwe gesa ivo ukulonda weye.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Kamala Yesu akabwela kwa wala wanahina watatu, akawafika wagona. Ivo akamuuza saimoni kwazina dimwenga akutangigwa Petulo, “Saimoni, vino kugona? Kupotwa kucheleza hata disaa dimwe?” <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Kamala akawalongela, “Chelezeni na kumulomba Mulungu msekwiza kuingila muna magezo ya mbuli zihile. Mweye mkulonda kufinyiliza magezo mbali mitufi yenu haikulonda.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Yesu akaita kaidi kumulomba Mulungu, na akaibwelela kuilonga mbuli ila ila. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Kamala akabwela kaidi akawafika wanahina wake wagona. Wakala na nt'hongo nk'hani, ivo hawamanyile mbuli ya kumulongela Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Ivo ezile kumwawe lwa katatu, akawalongela, “Vino munk'hali mgona na kuhumula? Elo inukeni! Chipindi chifika nie Mwana wa Mnt'hu kugaligwa kwa want'hu wehile. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Ivo timalaleni chiteni. Loleni, ila mnt'hu akulonda kunibiduka nie ahaguhi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aKugwiligwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Yesu ivo akalile ank'hali akulonga, ahoaho akeza Yuda Isikalioti, imwe wa wala wanahina kumi na waidi, akeza hamwenga na want'hu wengi, wana mapaga na mabalango. Want'hu ao wakala watumigwa na wakulu walava nt'hambiko na wafunza Malagilizo na vilongozi. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Ila Yuda Isikalioti akawenk'ha vilagiso, “Ila hulonda kumulamsa kwa kumkumbatila ndo yeye mgwileni.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Yuda ivo afikile, akaita dimwe kwa dimwe kwa Yesu, akamulamsa, “Mfunza!” Kamala akamkumbatila. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Ivo, wala want'hu wakamgwila Yesu na kumtatiliza. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Kamala imwe wa want'hu wakalile watimalala hant'hu hala hamwenga na Yesu, akadisomola panga dyake akamuhambula gutwi mtwana wa Mlava nt'hambiko Mkulu.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesu akawauza, “Vino hangi, mwiza na mapanga na mabalango kunigwila gesa vila nie mbavi? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Siku zose nikala hamwenga na mweye huwafunza kui Kaya ya Mulungu wala hamunigwile, mbali yano yakulawila haluse ili mbuli ziandikwe muna chitabu cha Mulungu yafikile.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Kamala wanahina wose wakasumka na kumuleka Yesu adumwe.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Kukala na mbwanga imwe akalile kavala golole, kakala akumkola Yesu. Ivo wamuonile wakalonda kumgwila. <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />Mbali ila mbwanga akapulusuka akauleka ula mgolole wake, akasumka kuno akimbwigili.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akugalwa muna chitala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Matayo 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55-63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohana 18:13-14-19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Kamala wakamgala Yesu kui kaya ya Mulava Nt'hambiko Mkulu. Walava nt'hambiko wakulu wose na vilongozi na wafunza Malagilizo wakala waifika hant'hu aho. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Petulo akamkola Yesu kwa kutali, akeingila mgati muna ua wa mlava nt'hambiko mkulu, akakala hamwenga na waamizi wakuotela moto. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na want'hu wose wa chitala wakalonda mbuli ikulonda kumtenda Yesu akomigwe, mbali hawapatile. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Want'hu wengi wakalonga mbuli za uhuni kuhusu Yesu, mbali mbuli zawe wazilongile hazilingane.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Kamala wakatimalala wamwenga. Wakalonga mbuli za kuhuna kuhusu Yesu, wakalonga, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />Chimuhulika mnt'hu ino akulonga, “Naibanange Kaya ya Mulungu izengigwe na want'hu, na kwa siku nt'hatu naaizenge imwenga ambayo hadikuzengwa na want'hu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Mbali hata ivo mbuli zawe wazilongile hazilingane.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Ivo, mulava nt'hambiko mkulu akatimalala hagati yawe akamuuza Yesu, “Vino, una mbuli yoyote yakulonga? Vino hukuona want'hu wose wano wakulonga mbuli zino kuhusu weye?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Mbali Yesu akanyamala tulu, halongile mbuli yoyote. Mlava nthambiko mkulu akamuuza kaidi, “Vino, weye ndo Kilisito, Mwana wa Mulungu akufugamalalilwa?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu akalonga, “Ena, ni nie. Mweye namnione nie Mwana wa Mnt'hu nidundumala ubanzi wa kulume wa Mulungu mwenye nguvu, nanize muna mawingu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Aho mulava nt'hambiko mkulu akaidega nk'hanzu yake kwa kulagisa maya, akalonga, “Hachikulonda want'hu wamwenga weze kugendelela kuchilongela mbuli zake. <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Wose muhulika vila akumdukana Mulungu! Elo mweye mkulonda chimtendeze?” Want'hu wose wa chitala wakalonga akomwe. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Ivo, want'hu wamwenga wakaandusa kumtemela mate, wakamgubika meso na kumtoa kamala wakamulongela, “Lotela niani akutowile!” Waamiizi wakamsola na kumtowa mank'huwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo akumbela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matayo 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohana 18:15-18-25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Petulo ivo akalile ank'hali mgati muuwa, akeza mtwana wa chike wa mulava nt'hambiko mkulu. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Ivo amuonile Petulo akuotela moto, akamulongela, “Vilavila na weye kukala hamwe na Yesu Mnazaleti.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Mbali Petulo akabela akalonga, “Simmanyile na simanyile icho ukulonga.” Kamala Petulo akasegela akaita kunze ya uwa. Aho zogolo dikalila. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Ila mtwana ivo ezile kumuona kaidi Petulo, akandusa kaidi kuwalongela want'hu wakalile watimalala hant'hu hala, “Ino nayo ni miyao.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Petulo akabela kaidi. Kamala want'hu wakalile watimalala hala wakamulongela Petulo, “Weye ni miyawe kwa vila ni mnt'hu wa Galilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Mbali Petulo akaandusa kuiduila na kuiapiza akalonga, “Mnt'hu iyo mkunisimulila mbuli zake nie hata simmanyile.” <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Ahoaho zogolo akalila lwa kaidi. Ivo, Petulo akakumbukila mbuli ila alongilwe na Yesu zogolo hanalila lwa kaidi, weye naunibele mala nt'hatu. Petulo akalila nk'hani.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akugalwa kulongozi kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohana 18:28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Nalugunzu gunzu, chitala chose, walava nt'hambiko wakulu, hamwenga na vilongozi na wafunza Malagilizo wakatogolelana wakamfunga mikono Yesu, wakamgala kwa Pilato akalile kilongozi wa Chilumi.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Ivo wafikile kwa Pilato, Pilato akamuza Yesu, “Vino weye ndo Mwene wa Wayahudi?” Yesu akamulongela, “Gesa weye ivo kulonga.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Walava nt'hambiko wakulu wakalonga mbuli nyingi za kuhuna kuhusu Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Kamala Pilato akamuuza kaidi Yesu, akalonga, “Kuhulika mbuli zose zikulongwa kuhusu weye! Vino una mbuli yoyote ya kuiyalala?”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Mbali Yesu halongile mbuli, ivo Pilato akakangawala.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulamulwa kukomwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yohana 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Kila ikafika sikunk'hulu ya Pasaka, Pilato kakala na ila ya kumulekela mfungigwa imwe want'hu wamulondile. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Kukala na mnt'hu imwe akutangwa Balaba, ino nae kakala kafungigwa hamwe na want'hu wehile wakalile walamulwa kwa kukoma na kutenda timbwayaya. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Kamala uyama wa want'hu ukamwitila Pilato na kumulomba awatendele gesa vila akuwatendelaga. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilato akawauza wala want'hu, “Vino, mkulonda nimulekele Mwene wa Wayahudi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Pilato Kalonga ivo kwa vila kamanya kuwa walava nt'hambiko wakulu wamgala Yesu kumwake kwa kumonela miongo.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Mbali mulava nt'hambiko mkulu akawasongeza want'hu wamulombe Pilato amlekele Balaba. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilato akawauza kaidi, “Elo mkulonda nimtendeze mnt'hu ino mkumtanga Mwene wa Wayahudi?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Want'hu wose wakatowa mazange wakalonga, “Muwambe mumsalaba.”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilato akawaauza, “kwani katenda mbuli ili ihile?” Mbali ao wakagendelela kutowa mazange na kulonga, “Muwambe mumsalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilato kalonda kuwabwedeza want'hu, ivo akamulekela Balaba kulawa mchifungo. Kamala akalagiliza Yesu asapuligwe na awambigwe mumsalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asikali wakumzela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Matayo 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohana 19:2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Kamala asikali wakamgala Yesu hai kaya ya Pilato akalile kilongozi wa Chilumi, kaya iyo itangigwa Pulaitolia. Umo ndo waduganyike asikali wose. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Wakamvika mwenda wa kimwene, wakaluka kigata cha miwa na kumvika Yesu mmutwi. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Kamala Wakandusa kumulamsa, “Mbukwa Mwene wa Wayahudi!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Wakamtoa mmutwi kwa mulugwa, wakamtemela mate, wakamtowela mavindi na kumwinamila. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Kamala ivo wakomeleze kumzela, wakamuhambula mwenda ula wa kimwene, wakamvika mwenda wake, kamala wakamgala akawambigwe.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwambigwa mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Ivo wakalile muinzila, wakafikana na mnt'hu imwe akutangwa Saimoni, mkaya wa bululu dya Kilene, tati yawe Alekizanda na Lufo. Mnt'hu iyo kakala akulawa kumgunda kwita kudibululu. Aho, asikali wakamsulutiza ausole msalaba wa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Kamala wakamgala Yesu hadi hant'hu hautangwa Goligota, manake ni pupa da mutwi. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Wakamwink'ha Yesu divai ihanganywe na dawa ya manemane, mbali yeye akailema kuing'wa. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Aho wakamuwamba Yesu kamala wakaigawila mienda yake kwa simbi niyani naapate chibwani. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Ikala saa nt'hatu ya lugunzu Yesu ivo akalile akuwambwa mumsalaba. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Mchanya mumsalaba wake wakala waandika kosa dyake vino, “Mwene wa Wayahudi.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Hamwenga nae, wakala wawambwa wabavi waidi mmisalaba, imwe kakala ubanzi wake wa kulume na imwenga ubanzi wake wa kumoso. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Aho zikalawila mbuli ziandikwe muna chitabu cha Mulungu zilongile, “Kaikwa hamwe na want'hu wehile.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bibilia zimwenga za umwaka zibule msitali uno.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Want'hu wakalile wakufosa hant'hu hala wakamdukana kuno wakutingisa mwitwi yawe na kulonga, “Hee! Weye mwenye kuibomola Kaya ya Mulungu na kuizenga kwa siku nt'hatu! <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Ihonye elo, telemka mumsalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Vilavila wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na wafunza malagilizo wakamzela Yesu kwa kulonga, “Kawahonya wamwenga, mbali yeye akupotwa kuihonya! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Leka chilole Kilisito mwene wa Waizilaeli ivo naatelemke kulawa mumsalaba ili chimtogole.” Vilavila hata wala waidi wawambigwe hamwenga na Yesu wakamdukana.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akudanganika mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Kwandusila saa sita ya msanya hadi saa tisa ya dihungile ziza dikaigubika isi yose. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Saa tisa ya dihungile, Yesu akalila kwa izi kulu, akalonga, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakitani?” Maanake, Mulungu wangu, Mulungu wangu, hangi kunileka?<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Want'hu wamwenga watimalalile hant'hu hala ivo wahulike ivo, wakalonga, “Tegelezeni! Miyenu akumtanga Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Mnt'hu imwe akasumka akaita kuchofeka sipomchi muna isiki na kuika mchanya mu lumango, kamala akamwink'ha Yesu ili aing'we, akalonga, “Goza chilole ge Eliya naeze kumtelemsa kulawa mumsalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Yesu akalila kwa usungu, akadanganika.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Aho panzia da kaya ya Mulungu dikadegeka mabanzi maidi kulawa kuchanya hadi hasi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Mkulu imwe wa asikali akalile katimalala kulongozi ya msalaba na kuona vila Yesu adanganike, akalonga, “Kweli mnt'hu ino ni Mwana wa Mulungu!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Ivila kukala na wanachike wamwenga wakalile wakulola kwa kutali. Imwenga wa ao kakala Malia kulawa kuna dibululu dya Magidala na Salome na Malia mami yawe Yakobo mdodo na Jose. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Wano wakala wamkumkola Yesu ivo akalile Galilaya na wakala wakumsank'hanila. Vilavila kukala na wanachike wamwenga wengi wezile Yelusalemu hamwenga na Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuzikwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Dihungile ikala ifika na iyo ikala siku ya kuisasala, kwa vila siku ya kaidi yake ni Siku ya Humulo, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />aho akeza Josefu mkaya wa Alimataya, mnt'hu wa chitala chikulu cha Wayahudi atogoligwe nk'hani. Ivila naye kakala akugozela kwiza kwa Umwene wa Mulungu. Ivo akamwitila Pilato bila kuogoha na akalomba apigwe mtufi wa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilato a kakangawala ivo ahulike Yesu kadanganika. Ivo akamtanga mkulu wa asikali na kumuuza mbuli iyo. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Pilato ivo alongelwe na ila mkulu wa asikali kuwa Yesu kadanganika, Pilato akamtogolela Josefu kuusola mtufi wa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Ivo Josefu akagula sanda na akautelesa mtufi wa Yesu kulawa mumsalaba, kamala akauvika sanda na kuuwika mgati ya kabuli dikalile disongolwe mditalawe. Kamala akabimbilisa ibwe kulu kugubika uuwingililo wa kabuli. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Malia wa kulawa Magidala na Malia mami yake Josefu wakahaona hant'hu ugonenezigwe mtufi wa Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akubwela muugima</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Ivo ifosile Siku ya Humulo, Malia wa kulawa Magidala na Salome na Malia mami yake Yakobo wakagula mavuta yadamane, waite wakauhake mtufi wa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Nalugunzu gunzu jumapili, zuwa ivo dikalile dikwandusa kulawa wakaita kuna dikabuli. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Ivo wakalile muinzila wakuiuza, “Vino niyani naadahe kudibimbilisa dila ibwe kulawa hauingililo wa dikabuli?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Ivo wakalile haguhi na kufika wakalola wakadiona dila ibwe dibimbiliswa kale kulawa hala ha uingililo wa dikabuli. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Ivo wakalile wakuingila mula mdikabuli, wakamuona mbwanga imwe kakala ubanzi wa kulume wa dikabuli kavala kanzu nzelu chwee, wakakangawala nk'hani. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Ila mbwanga akawalongela, “Msekukangawala. Mweye mkumulonda Yesu wa Nazaleti awambigwe mumsalaba. Mbali hano hahali Kabwela muugima. Loleni hano ndo hant'hu wakalile wamgoneza. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Elo gendeni mkawalongele mbuli ino wanahina wake haswahaswa Petulo kuwa Yesu kawalongolela kale kwita Galilaya, uko namumuone gesa vila awalongele.” <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Ivo, wakahalawa hadikabuli na wakasumka, kwa vila wakala waingilwa na woga na kukangawazwa. Hawamulongele mnt'hu yoyote mbuli izo kwa vila wakala wakuogoha nk'hani.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumulawila Malia wa kulawa Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matayo 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yohana 20:11-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Yesu ivo abwelile muugima lugunzu gunzu siku ya jumapili, tenk'hu akumulawila Malia wa kulawa Magidala, ila amulavile vinyamkela saba. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Malia wa kulawa Magidala akaita kuwalongela wala wakalile hamwenga na Yesu na chipindi icho wakala wakwomboleza na kulila. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Mbali ivo wezile kuhulika Yesu kabwela muugima na Malia wa kulawa Magidala kamwona, hawatogole.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwalawila wanahina waidi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luka 24:13-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Baadae Yesu akawalawila wanahina waidi kuno akuoneka muna isula imwenga. Wanahina ao wakala wakwita kumgunda. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Ivo wammanyile wakabwela ili wawalongele wayawe, mbali ao wayawe hawatogole.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwalawila wanahina kumi na imwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Nt'hendwa 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Kamala Yesu akawalawila wala wanahina wake kumi na imwe ivo wakalile wakudya. Yesu akawabwakila kwa vila ya udala wa myoyo yawe, kwa vila hawawatogole wala wamuonile Yesu kuwa kabwela muugima. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Kamala akawalongela, “Gendeni mui isi yose mkazilonge Mbuli Zidamane kwa want'hu wose. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Mnt'hu yoyote akulonda kutogola na kubatizigwa naahonyigwe. Mnt'hu hakutogola naalamulwe. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Na vilagiso vino navikolane na wala watogole na kwa udahi wa zina dyangu nawalave vinyamkela na nawalonge kwa ulonzi umwenga. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Na wakatoza nyoka egu kung'wa kint'hu chochote cha kukoma sekechiwalumiza na nawawaikile watamu mikono na ao nawahone.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aupaa kwita kuulanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Nt'hendwa 1:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Kamala Mndewa Yesu ivo akomeleze kulonga nawo, akapaa kwita kuchanya kuulanga. Akakala ubanzi wa kulume wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Kamala wanahina wake wakaita kila hant'hu kuzilonga Mbuli Zidamane za Mulungu. Mndewa Yesu kakala akusank'hana hamwenga nao na kulagisa Mbuli Idamane ilongigwe ni ya kweli kwa kufosela uzonza utendeke hagati yawe.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>